1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:02:59,250
Visit turkision.com for more!

2
00:03:01,000 --> 00:03:05,519
Oh praise be! Praise be!

3
00:03:06,000 --> 00:03:09,519
Praise be. Come on.

4
00:03:21,480 --> 00:03:26,519
Come on, sons!

5
00:03:28,000 --> 00:03:29,039
Come on!

6
00:03:29,040 --> 00:03:42,519
-Allah is Eternal!
-Allah is Right!

7
00:03:45,480 --> 00:03:50,039
Even the iron couldn't stand
our dikhr. Faith came alive in it

8
00:03:50,040 --> 00:03:53,519
Otherwise it cannot be a weapon for Turks, brother.

9
00:03:59,000 --> 00:04:03,039
Allah created iron and horses to serve us.

10
00:04:03,040 --> 00:04:08,039
Thanks to Allah, we've
become His army in the world.

11
00:04:09,480 --> 00:04:14,039
When our ancestors melted the iron
mountain and got out, it was a spring day.

12
00:04:14,040 --> 00:04:18,039
Spring brings victory to us.

13
00:04:19,000 --> 00:04:23,039
Now Newroz and Ramadan are coinciding.

14
00:04:25,480 --> 00:04:28,519
We will celebrate them in
our tribe, if Allah permits.

15
00:04:28,520 --> 00:04:30,519
-If Allah permits.
-If Allah permits, my Bey.

16
00:04:30,520 --> 00:04:34,519
-If Allah permits.
-Blacksmith!

17
00:04:36,480 --> 00:04:41,039
Come here. Well...

18
00:04:41,040 --> 00:04:43,519
Prepare this sword by Newroz.

19
00:04:43,520 --> 00:04:46,039
I will cut off Imren's head with this.

20
00:04:46,040 --> 00:04:48,519
-As you order, Osman Bey.
-By the way...

21
00:04:48,520 --> 00:04:51,039
...increase the number of forges in the tribe.

22
00:04:51,040 --> 00:04:53,519
I want a thousand swords ready by the holiday.

23
00:04:54,000 --> 00:04:56,519
As you order, my Bey.

24
00:04:57,480 --> 00:05:00,519
Alright. Let's go.

25
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:07,039
As Franks settled in Karacapinar, it
means the hunting season has begun, Boran.

26
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:11,039
As you said, my Bey. Our warriors
have been going after them for two days.

27
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:16,039
They built headquarters in that
area and took strict measures.

28
00:05:16,040 --> 00:05:22,039
Franks are the scouts of
Crusaders. If we can't break them...

29
00:05:22,480 --> 00:05:26,519
...they will join Imren. We can't let that happen.

30
00:05:27,000 --> 00:05:31,519
Which measures could stand against
the sword forged with dhikr, my Bey?

31
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:36,519
We'll go to fight but they
will think we're going to hunt.

32
00:05:39,000 --> 00:05:42,039
Shepherd!

33
00:05:42,480 --> 00:05:45,039
-Peace be upon you
-Peace be upon you too, my Bey.

34
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:50,039
Look at these.

35
00:05:50,040 --> 00:05:53,039
It's time for them to be tagged.

36
00:05:53,040 --> 00:05:56,039
Tag them in a week. As you order, my Bey.

37
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:58,519
Let's go. Let's go.

38
00:05:58,520 --> 00:06:00,519
Come on.

39
00:06:00,520 --> 00:06:03,519
Come on, let's go.

40
00:06:52,480 --> 00:06:56,519
Don't run! You're losing meat by running!

41
00:06:57,000 --> 00:07:01,039
Father! Father!

42
00:07:01,480 --> 00:07:04,519
You never stop bragging and you're losing a fight?

43
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:15,519
Ghazi, come give us a hand.
The tribe should be ready quickly.

44
00:07:17,000 --> 00:07:20,039
Hey, brother!
We're under attack!

45
00:07:20,480 --> 00:07:23,039
Watch out!

46
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:29,039
Ghazi, come here!

47
00:07:32,480 --> 00:07:35,039
Brother!

48
00:08:08,480 --> 00:08:12,039
Praise be! Praise be!

49
00:08:12,040 --> 00:08:18,039
Look at that. The tribe is good not
only for hatuns but also for lltutan.

50
00:08:18,480 --> 00:08:20,519
Look at those moves!

51
00:08:20,520 --> 00:08:23,519
He lies down there so good

52
00:08:27,480 --> 00:08:33,039
Praise be! Wherever he
steps, he makes it a homeland!

53
00:08:33,480 --> 00:08:37,519
Well, Solgur Agha. That's why.,
we call him lltutan (Homemaker).

54
00:08:39,480 --> 00:08:44,039
You see, my Bey? Even
horses are happy for the spring!

55
00:08:47,000 --> 00:08:52,039
When we go hunting, we'll be
happy as well, if Allah permits.

56
00:08:52,040 --> 00:08:56,519
If Allah permits, my Bey.

57
00:09:16,000 --> 00:09:18,519
They are beautiful.

58
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:29,519
May your work be easy, hatuns!

59
00:09:29,520 --> 00:09:35,039
-Thank you.
-Praise be. Give it to me.

60
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:52,519
Praise be!

61
00:09:57,000 --> 00:10:01,039
It looks great, huh?

62
00:10:07,000 --> 00:10:09,519
They are wonderful.

63
00:10:11,480 --> 00:10:15,039
When they are embroidered,
their colors will look so nice.

64
00:10:15,040 --> 00:10:19,039
Yes. It makes us feel refreshed, huh?

65
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:23,039
Come here!

66
00:10:23,040 --> 00:10:26,519
-You are my iftar food!
-Stop running! You're fasting!

67
00:10:26,520 --> 00:10:31,039
-You will sweat too much, Ghazi!
-Ghazi, isn't that my goat?

68
00:10:31,040 --> 00:10:35,519
-Leave it alone! Ghazi! Ghazi!
-Well...

69
00:10:41,480 --> 00:10:45,039
Come on, hatuns!

70
00:10:54,000 --> 00:10:58,039
Stop, Elcim Hatun. I can carry it.

71
00:11:01,480 --> 00:11:04,039
The tribe makes everyone feel refreshed.

72
00:11:04,040 --> 00:11:07,519
-Osman Bey was just on point about this.
-Yes.

73
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:14,039
We really missed it. After all,
we weren't raised in the palace.

74
00:11:14,480 --> 00:11:18,519
Ha? Thanks to this, you've seen our true nature.

75
00:11:21,480 --> 00:11:26,519
-Actually, I want to talk to you about something.
-Go ahead, Elcim Hatun.

76
00:11:28,480 --> 00:11:34,519
We haven't had the chance to
talk after... after Holofira's death.

77
00:11:48,480 --> 00:11:54,039
There is nothing to talk about, Elcim
Hatun. Everything is apparent now.

78
00:11:54,480 --> 00:11:58,039
I am very sorry, Orhan Bey.

79
00:11:59,000 --> 00:12:02,519
I was very angry at first..

80
00:12:02,520 --> 00:12:05,519
..however, I did not want anyone to die.

81
00:12:07,480 --> 00:12:11,519
I know. I know, Elcim Hatun.

82
00:12:11,520 --> 00:12:15,519
I saw how you tried your
best for Holofira at the court.

83
00:12:15,520 --> 00:12:19,519
However, I don't want to
talk about this matter anymore.

84
00:12:20,000 --> 00:12:23,039
And you shouldn't think about it anymore.

85
00:12:27,480 --> 00:12:31,519
We are going on a road with
you. There will be a wedding for us.

86
00:12:32,000 --> 00:12:36,519
For the good of the two
tribes, we are doing our duty.

87
00:12:36,520 --> 00:12:40,039
I want your heart and your mind..

88
00:12:40,480 --> 00:12:43,519
..to be at the good of our tribe.

89
00:12:43,520 --> 00:12:46,519
The future of our family.

90
00:12:47,480 --> 00:12:51,039
I want the same from you too, Orhan Bey.

91
00:12:51,480 --> 00:12:56,519
May your heart and mind
be at the future of our family.

92
00:13:08,480 --> 00:13:13,519
Thank you, Elcim Hatun.

93
00:13:31,000 --> 00:13:34,519
A change of place would be good we
said, and we here we are in the tents.

94
00:13:34,520 --> 00:13:37,039
Thank Allah.
Thank Allah.

95
00:13:37,040 --> 00:13:40,519
The tents are good for us in Ramadan Mubarak.

96
00:13:41,000 --> 00:13:44,039
They are.

97
00:13:44,040 --> 00:13:49,039
If Allah permits, we will
make the wedding here as well.

98
00:13:52,000 --> 00:13:58,039
If Allah permits, my Bey.
It will be a great festive.

99
00:13:59,000 --> 00:14:02,039
It will be.

100
00:14:03,480 --> 00:14:09,519
So, it is tradition. We need to go on a hunt.

101
00:14:12,000 --> 00:14:16,039
However, this hunt will be different.

102
00:14:16,480 --> 00:14:19,519
This is not an animal hunt.

103
00:14:20,000 --> 00:14:23,039
It will be a hunt for crusaders.

104
00:14:25,480 --> 00:14:27,519
No one will know about it.

105
00:14:29,000 --> 00:14:31,039
May you prevail, my Bey.

106
00:14:31,040 --> 00:14:34,039
-May you not falter.
-Thank you.

107
00:14:34,480 --> 00:14:37,039
May you hunt well, Osman Bey.

108
00:14:37,480 --> 00:14:41,039
Thanks. Then, let it be glorious.

109
00:14:45,000 --> 00:14:47,519
Come on, valiants.

110
00:15:17,480 --> 00:15:20,519
Let me go! Let me!

111
00:15:20,520 --> 00:15:23,039
-Let me go!
-Come on!

112
00:15:24,000 --> 00:15:27,039
Did you think Germiyanid Mehmed
Bey let you get away with this?

113
00:15:27,480 --> 00:15:31,519
Alaeddin! You are dragging me everywhere

114
00:15:34,000 --> 00:15:40,039
However, I promise that I will not let you have it.

115
00:15:41,480 --> 00:15:44,039
Tell me! What happened?

116
00:15:44,040 --> 00:15:46,519
Shut it, Mehmed Bey

117
00:15:47,000 --> 00:15:50,039
Take your alps and leave my tribe.

118
00:15:51,480 --> 00:15:56,039
We thought you were honest and forgave you.

119
00:15:56,480 --> 00:15:59,519
Osman Bey let infidels
have the Frontier Marketplace.

120
00:15:59,520 --> 00:16:05,519
He killed my soldiers. You are
making a mistake by not killing me.

121
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:17,519
If I am Germiyanid Mehmed Bey,
I will make your lives unbearable.

122
00:16:19,480 --> 00:16:26,039
Here is us and our lives. Do it if you can, Mehmed.

123
00:16:28,000 --> 00:16:30,519
Now, get out!

124
00:16:49,480 --> 00:16:55,039
It seems your justice and mercy cannot be trusted.

125
00:16:57,000 --> 00:17:01,039
They do not understand, Gonca.

126
00:17:01,480 --> 00:17:05,039
From now on, our swords will speak.

127
00:17:26,480 --> 00:17:30,519
My son, we cannot trust Mehmed..

128
00:17:31,000 --> 00:17:34,039
..until we find out who told
Imren about Kite stronghold.

129
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:38,039
He might be the traitor.

130
00:17:38,040 --> 00:17:42,519
He is mad and all, however,
he is no traitor mother.

131
00:17:42,520 --> 00:17:46,039
We will see. If he is not a traitor..

132
00:17:46,040 --> 00:17:49,039
...he will gather his alps
and attack Imren at once.

133
00:17:49,040 --> 00:17:54,039
If he is a traitor, if he made a deal with Imren...

134
00:17:54,480 --> 00:17:58,039
...then you know what to do.

135
00:17:58,480 --> 00:18:02,519
I will find out who Mehmed sided with.

136
00:18:02,520 --> 00:18:08,039
Alaeddin. If Mehmed betrayed us...

137
00:18:08,040 --> 00:18:11,519
...then, you are allowed to kill him, my son.

138
00:18:12,000 --> 00:18:15,519
It is Osman Bey's command. I know...

139
00:18:16,000 --> 00:18:19,519
...your duty is difficult, however..

140
00:18:19,520 --> 00:18:23,039
Osman Bey's command is above it, mother.

141
00:18:23,480 --> 00:18:29,519
A traitor will always be a traitor.
What needs to be done will be done.

142
00:18:32,000 --> 00:18:34,519
I'll be on my way.

143
00:18:41,000 --> 00:18:45,039
Come on!

144
00:18:52,000 --> 00:18:57,039
Difficult challenges await you, my
son. May Allah show you the way.

145
00:19:40,000 --> 00:19:43,039
Peace be upon you, my Bey.

146
00:19:44,480 --> 00:19:46,519
Peace be upon you too.

147
00:19:46,520 --> 00:19:51,039
My Bey, as you have commanded, Turahan
snuck in among frenks as he saw them.

148
00:19:52,000 --> 00:19:57,039
-Tell me.
-He has written their plans here.

149
00:19:57,480 --> 00:19:59,519
However, they will not be alone.

150
00:19:59,520 --> 00:20:04,039
Imren ordered them to unite with Catalans and walk.

151
00:20:05,000 --> 00:20:07,519
They will meet up tomorrow.

152
00:20:07,520 --> 00:20:11,039
Before that, a Catalan unit
will come to frank encampment.

153
00:20:11,480 --> 00:20:15,519
-What about the location of Catalans?
-I still could not find it, my Bey.

154
00:20:16,480 --> 00:20:19,039
Alright.

155
00:20:19,040 --> 00:20:21,519
You gave me information about their plans.

156
00:20:23,480 --> 00:20:26,039
Now, we will look for information
outside. Do not stay among them anymore.

157
00:20:26,040 --> 00:20:31,519
-We will destroy the place at night.
-As you command, my Bey.

158
00:21:20,480 --> 00:21:24,039
-Fatma Hatun.
-Was there anything suspicious?

159
00:21:24,480 --> 00:21:28,039
There was a secret meeting with a
man. It was made in quite secrecy.

160
00:21:28,480 --> 00:21:31,519
After that, the man passed along a letter to her.

161
00:21:32,000 --> 00:21:36,039
We will see what that letter is about.

162
00:21:50,000 --> 00:21:52,519
Take it over there.

163
00:21:57,000 --> 00:22:00,519
Praise be to you my daughter.
You did not stop for a moment.

164
00:22:01,480 --> 00:22:04,331
At this pace we'll finish
settling in two days, huh?

165
00:22:04,343 --> 00:22:06,039
Thank you, I'm one of you now.

166
00:22:14,000 --> 00:22:16,519
-Hah, Ulgen.
-The clothes have come, Malhun Hatun.

167
00:22:16,520 --> 00:22:20,039
You arrived just in time, Ulgen.
Come on, bring them here.

168
00:22:20,480 --> 00:22:24,039
Come, my daughter. Come.

169
00:22:25,000 --> 00:22:28,039
The clothes for your wedding dress have arrived.

170
00:22:28,040 --> 00:22:30,519
We need to start sewing them quickly.

171
00:22:31,000 --> 00:22:34,519
Look, my daughter, if you
like any of these, let me know.

172
00:22:38,000 --> 00:22:41,039
Look... Look at this...

173
00:22:41,480 --> 00:22:45,519
This color would suit you very well, huh?

174
00:22:49,000 --> 00:22:54,039
And this one's color is also
very beautiful, it would suit you.

175
00:22:57,000 --> 00:23:00,519
Do you think it will be ready
for the wedding, Malhun Hatun?

176
00:23:00,520 --> 00:23:04,039
There's a lot to do with the tribe and the wedding.

177
00:23:04,040 --> 00:23:07,519
What should we do? Should we postpone the wedding?

178
00:23:11,000 --> 00:23:15,519
We'll figure things out,
don't worry, my daughter...

179
00:23:15,520 --> 00:23:19,519
...it will be ready in time,
we will manage it together.

180
00:23:26,480 --> 00:23:29,039
Mother...

181
00:23:30,000 --> 00:23:34,519
Mute girl came from the marketplace.
She met someone in the marketplace.

182
00:23:35,000 --> 00:23:38,519
Keep an eye on her, my Fatma.

183
00:23:42,000 --> 00:23:45,039
Come on. Come on, Ulgen, let's open these chests.

184
00:23:45,480 --> 00:23:49,039
Let's see the things we have.

185
00:23:52,000 --> 00:23:55,479
Look...

186
00:24:10,000 --> 00:24:13,519
Our Alps are ready to march to
the Frankish headquarters, my Bey.

187
00:24:14,000 --> 00:24:18,039
They will wait, they will wait.

188
00:24:18,040 --> 00:24:23,039
We will gather intelligence around the
headquarters. Catalans and Franks are uniting.

189
00:24:23,040 --> 00:24:25,519
When, my Bey? -Tomorrow.

190
00:24:25,520 --> 00:24:29,039
That's why we will attack them
tonight. There is no other way.

191
00:24:29,480 --> 00:24:33,519
We will quickly gather intelligence
and whatever else is needed, my Bey.

192
00:24:33,520 --> 00:24:37,519
But since their main goal is Al-Quds..

193
00:24:40,000 --> 00:24:41,519
...they have come with heavy weapons.
-Don't worry.

194
00:24:41,520 --> 00:24:47,039
Everything is written here. We
will make all our moves accordingly.

195
00:24:49,000 --> 00:24:52,124
Let them take whatever
precautions they want, my Bey.

196
00:24:52,136 --> 00:24:55,039
They are in the wrong
lands, facing the wrong men.

197
00:24:57,000 --> 00:25:00,039
What will Imren Tegin say to this, my Bey?

198
00:25:00,040 --> 00:25:05,039
Imren will think Catalans attacked the Franks.

199
00:25:05,040 --> 00:25:09,039
The Catalan vanguard is coming, we will use them.

200
00:25:10,000 --> 00:25:13,519
Come on, we will get close to the
quarters. We will think about our move.

201
00:25:14,000 --> 00:25:18,039
-Yes my Bey!
-Yes my Bey!

202
00:25:18,480 --> 00:25:22,039
Come on! Come on!

203
00:25:52,480 --> 00:25:55,519
Goat-smelling barbarians...

204
00:25:56,480 --> 00:25:58,999
Damn it.

205
00:25:59,040 --> 00:26:02,039
Look at me. I look like a servant.

206
00:26:07,000 --> 00:26:11,039
I endure this disgrace to kill you all...

207
00:26:22,480 --> 00:26:27,039
Andra... Fill up that bucket, pour it over these.

208
00:26:27,040 --> 00:26:30,039
I will make them pay for this.

209
00:26:45,480 --> 00:26:48,519
May it be easy, Olivia Hatun.

210
00:26:52,000 --> 00:26:58,039
-Do you need anything?
-Thank you.

211
00:26:58,040 --> 00:27:02,519
I guess Osman Bey went somewhere important.

212
00:27:02,520 --> 00:27:06,039
The joy of the people could be heard from my tent.

213
00:27:06,040 --> 00:27:08,519
One foot of the Turk is at the wedding...

214
00:27:09,000 --> 00:27:12,039
...the other is in the hunt.

215
00:27:12,040 --> 00:27:14,519
And Osman Bey went hunting.

216
00:27:16,480 --> 00:27:21,039
Tell me... Have you gotten used to the tribal life?

217
00:27:22,480 --> 00:27:25,039
I have.

218
00:27:28,480 --> 00:27:31,519
Holofira might be guilty...

219
00:27:31,520 --> 00:27:34,039
...but her death really hurt me.

220
00:27:35,000 --> 00:27:37,519
Being here makes me feel good.

221
00:27:38,480 --> 00:27:42,519
Holofira was in a poisonous love.

222
00:27:42,520 --> 00:27:45,039
And it ended when she died.

223
00:27:45,040 --> 00:27:47,519
May Allah forgive her sins.

224
00:27:47,520 --> 00:27:52,039
From now on, we will look ahead.

225
00:27:53,000 --> 00:27:56,519
May it be easy.

226
00:28:31,000 --> 00:28:35,519
Take these to the dowry tent. They
are all heirlooms from my mother.

227
00:28:35,520 --> 00:28:40,039
They are all handcraft. Place them in a good spot.

228
00:28:41,480 --> 00:28:44,039
Holofira got what she deserved.

229
00:28:45,480 --> 00:28:48,039
But the fire in my heart hasn't cooled down yet.

230
00:28:48,040 --> 00:28:52,039
Her head should have been
taken, paraded through city after city.

231
00:28:52,040 --> 00:28:56,519
She paid for what she did, why are you still angry?

232
00:29:05,480 --> 00:29:11,519
Aunt...

233
00:30:00,480 --> 00:30:05,039
Ayca... What are you looking at?

234
00:30:07,480 --> 00:30:10,039
You don't seem well.

235
00:30:11,000 --> 00:30:15,039
I am alright. I am alright.

236
00:30:16,480 --> 00:30:19,519
I will be even better.

237
00:30:58,000 --> 00:31:02,039
Thanks to Allah, my daughter.
You've been sleeping for days.

238
00:31:03,480 --> 00:31:08,039
-Nothing bad happened, right?
-No. Our game worked.

239
00:31:08,480 --> 00:31:11,039
Everyone thinks you are dead.

240
00:31:11,040 --> 00:31:13,519
We were scared when it got late, but...

241
00:31:14,480 --> 00:31:18,039
...but Alaeddin had already
informed us about this in advance.

242
00:31:18,480 --> 00:31:21,039
You don't have any pain or ache, right?

243
00:31:21,480 --> 00:31:24,519
No. I am alright.

244
00:31:25,480 --> 00:31:30,039
It happened just as he said, I
haven't slept like this in a long time.

245
00:31:30,040 --> 00:31:35,519
Good. Good, praise be. Holofira...

246
00:31:35,520 --> 00:31:38,519
It was a dangerous game, my daughter.

247
00:31:38,520 --> 00:31:41,039
You accepted without any hesitation.

248
00:31:41,040 --> 00:31:43,519
I did my duty.

249
00:31:43,520 --> 00:31:48,039
I hope the truth comes out soon.

250
00:31:52,000 --> 00:31:56,039
I never did something like that.

251
00:31:57,000 --> 00:32:01,039
-What about this ring?
-It belongs to my aunt.

252
00:32:07,000 --> 00:32:10,039
There was poison in this.

253
00:32:11,480 --> 00:32:16,519
Did she... Did she do this?

254
00:32:17,000 --> 00:32:20,039
The evidence is pointing to her, Holofira.

255
00:32:20,040 --> 00:32:24,519
But why? Why would she do this?

256
00:32:24,520 --> 00:32:27,519
To prevent the union of the two Kayi tribes.

257
00:32:27,520 --> 00:32:31,519
Apparently Olivia Hatun
is still serving Imren Tegin.

258
00:32:34,000 --> 00:32:36,039
How could she do this?

259
00:32:36,040 --> 00:32:41,039
And she did it even knowing that
everyone would blame you, Holofira.

260
00:32:44,480 --> 00:32:49,039
Will you kill her? -Not now.

261
00:32:50,000 --> 00:32:54,039
First, she will tell us the
names of those who help her...

262
00:32:54,480 --> 00:32:58,039
...and the location of Imren
Tegin's secret passages.

263
00:32:59,000 --> 00:33:03,519
She will tell us for justice to prevail. But...

264
00:33:04,000 --> 00:33:08,039
...you will secure the justice.

265
00:33:10,480 --> 00:33:15,039
How am I going to do this? -By dying.

266
00:33:18,480 --> 00:33:22,039
No one but those in this room will know this.

267
00:33:22,040 --> 00:33:25,519
We will host you in the lodge
for some time, my daughter.

268
00:33:25,520 --> 00:33:28,519
Being here will be very good for me.

269
00:33:28,520 --> 00:33:34,039
But... Orhan must not know that I am here.

270
00:33:35,000 --> 00:33:39,039
I know. If he knows, he can't
stop himself, he'll come here.

271
00:33:39,480 --> 00:33:45,039
Holofira...
-Orhan and Elcim must get married for your cause.

272
00:33:46,000 --> 00:33:49,039
And I will do my duty.

273
00:33:49,480 --> 00:33:52,519
I will stay away from Orhan.

274
00:33:53,480 --> 00:33:57,519
When you learn the secret
passages of Abranos from my aunt...

275
00:33:57,520 --> 00:34:00,519
...I will go to Constantinople.

276
00:34:01,000 --> 00:34:07,519
I will disappear, Bala Hatun.
This is the best for all of us.

277
00:34:10,480 --> 00:34:16,039
You're tearing out your heart with your own
hands, and not even a sound is coming out.

278
00:34:17,480 --> 00:34:22,039
Loving someone is easy, falling in love is easy...

279
00:34:22,040 --> 00:34:27,039
...but giving up on that love...
Not everyone can do that.

280
00:34:29,000 --> 00:34:35,039
I understand that you don't
just love Orhan, my daughter.

281
00:34:35,480 --> 00:34:40,039
His heart is engraved onto yours, my daughter.

282
00:34:40,480 --> 00:34:43,039
Otherwise, you couldn't do this.

283
00:34:44,000 --> 00:34:48,039
Know that giving
up on such a love..

284
00:34:48,040 --> 00:34:52,039
..is greater than many reunions.

285
00:34:53,480 --> 00:34:59,039
You are doing what suits you, your love.

286
00:34:59,480 --> 00:35:02,039
Don't forget this.

287
00:35:08,000 --> 00:35:13,519
I’ll go to the tribe now. If you
need anything inform Kismet.

288
00:35:17,480 --> 00:35:21,039
Actually, there's something.

289
00:35:21,040 --> 00:35:23,519
I want to...

290
00:35:24,480 --> 00:35:27,519
...learn about Islam.

291
00:35:31,000 --> 00:35:36,519
This was the condition to
get married with Orhan, right?

292
00:35:38,000 --> 00:35:41,039
Do you still want it?

293
00:35:41,480 --> 00:35:45,519
Not for Orhan, I want it for myself.

294
00:35:47,000 --> 00:35:52,519
I'm curious about your religion and your Prophet.

295
00:36:34,480 --> 00:36:36,039
Peace be upon you.

296
00:36:36,040 --> 00:36:41,039
-Peace be upon you too my Bey.
-Peace be upon you too my Bey.

297
00:36:43,480 --> 00:36:47,519
Beys, alps.

298
00:36:47,520 --> 00:36:51,039
According to the latest information we got.

299
00:36:51,040 --> 00:36:56,039
...our move won't be easy at
all. But with Allah's permission

300
00:36:56,040 --> 00:36:59,519
...not a single Frenk will be left until tonight.

301
00:37:05,000 --> 00:37:08,519
they split into three parts when
they want to defend their outpost,

302
00:37:09,000 --> 00:37:13,039
so we will attack from three
sides as soon as possible.

303
00:37:13,040 --> 00:37:19,519
Their outpost is from here to there.

304
00:37:20,480 --> 00:37:25,519
There are infantry with shields
at the front side of their outpost.

305
00:37:25,520 --> 00:37:29,039
And behind them there are speared soldiers.

306
00:37:29,480 --> 00:37:33,039
They are waiting to face our horses.

307
00:37:33,040 --> 00:37:37,039
In the back they have long-range archers.

308
00:37:37,040 --> 00:37:42,039
Alps with steel shields will face them.

309
00:37:42,040 --> 00:37:47,039
-You will be leading them, Gunduz Bey.
-Okay Osman Bey.

310
00:37:47,480 --> 00:37:50,519
Boran Bey's archers will protect you from behind.

311
00:37:50,520 --> 00:37:53,039
Yes, my Bey.

312
00:37:53,040 --> 00:37:56,039
Their arrows will be broken
on our shields if Allah permits.

313
00:37:56,480 --> 00:38:00,519
-That's for sure.
-Our alps' arrows will kill them, if Allah permits.

314
00:38:00,520 --> 00:38:04,039
Only if Allah permits. Now,

315
00:38:04,040 --> 00:38:07,519
At the back sides of their outpost

316
00:38:07,520 --> 00:38:11,519
there are their horses to defend
a possible attack from the front.

317
00:38:12,000 --> 00:38:16,519
If they see any attack from there,
they will want to run to the horses.

318
00:38:16,520 --> 00:38:19,519
And infantry with swords
are waiting around the horses.

319
00:38:19,520 --> 00:38:22,039
So, Orhan Bey

320
00:38:22,480 --> 00:38:24,519
-My Bey.
-With your alps

321
00:38:24,520 --> 00:38:28,039
you will attack from this side and destroy them.

322
00:38:28,040 --> 00:38:30,519
Yes, my Bey. We will be
like storm, if Allah permits.

323
00:38:30,520 --> 00:38:34,039
Alright. After we attack from both sides

324
00:38:34,040 --> 00:38:40,039
we will attack from the middle
and we will ruin the army.

325
00:38:40,480 --> 00:38:46,519
And we will cut the head of the Frenk leader

326
00:38:47,000 --> 00:38:50,039
they will either leave our lands

327
00:38:50,480 --> 00:38:53,039
or we will bury them in these lands.

328
00:38:53,040 --> 00:38:58,039
-If Allah permits, my Bey.
-If Allah permits, my Bey.

329
00:39:02,000 --> 00:39:07,039
Let the darkness settle,
then we will start our move.

330
00:39:07,040 --> 00:39:12,039
But first we will destroy the Frenk patrols.

331
00:39:12,480 --> 00:39:16,519
So that our move can be smooth.

332
00:39:17,000 --> 00:39:23,039
Before that, we will destroy
Catalans who will come to meet them.

333
00:39:23,480 --> 00:39:26,519
This will be very important for our move.

334
00:39:26,520 --> 00:39:30,039
My Beys, my alps, my brave boys.

335
00:39:30,480 --> 00:39:34,519
The path is pretty rough, but we are also tough.

336
00:39:34,520 --> 00:39:37,519
With the permission of Allah we will handle this.

337
00:39:38,000 --> 00:39:41,519
-May our holy war be blessed.
-Aameen.

338
00:39:42,480 --> 00:39:47,039
Come on, everybody take your places.

339
00:40:11,480 --> 00:40:16,039
Gonca, you will go to Kutahya and
inform my father about the situation.

340
00:40:16,480 --> 00:40:19,519
Brother, let me fight by your side.

341
00:40:20,000 --> 00:40:22,519
No, you will do as I say!

342
00:40:27,480 --> 00:40:32,039
When my alps come, I'll take the Frontier
Marketplace back, I'll avenge my alps!

343
00:40:36,480 --> 00:40:41,039
What happened Gonca? Why are you keeping
silent? You trusted Osman Bey a lot.

344
00:40:41,040 --> 00:40:44,519
He stabbed us in the back. But I knew it.

345
00:40:45,000 --> 00:40:50,039
I knew Osman was not reliable.
If I'm Mehmed Bey, son of Yakup...

346
00:40:50,040 --> 00:40:55,039
...I'll make Imren, Osman and
his impudent sons pay for this!

347
00:40:55,040 --> 00:40:58,519
How can you do it with a few alps, brother?

348
00:40:59,000 --> 00:41:02,519
Even if I'm alone, I'll take
that marketplace back Gonca.

349
00:41:03,480 --> 00:41:09,039
Wow, who are you to take the marketplace, Mehmed?

350
00:41:09,040 --> 00:41:14,519
And you will do it all alone, is that so?

351
00:41:14,520 --> 00:41:18,039
You can only talk behind us, Mehmed.

352
00:41:18,040 --> 00:41:21,519
-You can’t do anything else.
-Alaeddin!

353
00:41:22,000 --> 00:41:24,519
Brother, brother.

354
00:41:26,480 --> 00:41:32,519
First you killed my alps and
now you're messing with me.

355
00:41:33,480 --> 00:41:36,039
Alaeddin!

356
00:41:45,000 --> 00:41:48,519
-You won’t stop, right?
-Brother, don't! Alaeddin!

357
00:41:58,480 --> 00:42:02,039
Alaeddin, stop!

358
00:42:03,000 --> 00:42:07,519
What are you after again, Alaeddin?
You didn't kill me in the tribe...

359
00:42:07,520 --> 00:42:12,039
-...but you're ambushing me in the forest, right?
-So you're determined to kill Imran...

360
00:42:12,040 --> 00:42:14,519
-...and take the marketplace, is that so?
-Why?

361
00:42:14,520 --> 00:42:17,519
-Are you defending Imren Tegin now, Alaeddin Bey?

362
00:42:19,480 --> 00:42:24,039
I'm just curious what Mehmed
Bey will do, Gonca Hatun.

363
00:42:25,480 --> 00:42:28,519
-So you're not a traitor, is that so?
-You're the traitor!

364
00:42:28,520 --> 00:42:32,039
Your father is the traitor! My marketplace...

365
00:42:32,040 --> 00:42:36,039
You gave my marketplace to the infidels.

366
00:42:36,480 --> 00:42:41,519
I won't let Imren or you take my lands.

367
00:42:56,000 --> 00:43:03,039
You're a brave man, but I wish you
could show it more often, Mehmed Bey.

368
00:43:03,040 --> 00:43:07,519
Alps, lower your weapons!

369
00:43:13,480 --> 00:43:19,039
Now, what I'm saying
is... It is hard for you, but...

370
00:43:19,480 --> 00:43:23,039
Be patient, wait for a while,

371
00:43:23,040 --> 00:43:26,519
and let's ruin Imren in the marketplace together.

372
00:43:28,000 --> 00:43:32,559
-What are you saying, Alaeddin?
-Your alps are alive, Mehmed Bey.

373
00:43:33,480 --> 00:43:38,039
But it seems you will not be
at ease until you see them.

374
00:43:39,000 --> 00:43:43,519
Let's get there and I'll tell you all about it.

375
00:44:23,000 --> 00:44:28,039
They’re coming, my Bey.
-Let them come.

376
00:44:28,480 --> 00:44:31,519
Let them come.

377
00:44:39,000 --> 00:44:41,039
Orhan Bey!
-My Bey!

378
00:44:41,040 --> 00:44:43,039
-Come oni
-Yes, my Bey.

379
00:44:43,040 --> 00:44:44,519
Alps!

380
00:44:44,520 --> 00:44:48,039
-Come oni
-Yes, my Bey!

381
00:45:53,480 --> 00:45:58,039
-My Bey, won't we attack? Their numbers
are equal, they are struggling in vain.

382
00:46:02,480 --> 00:46:06,039
No. They should win it easily when they are equal

383
00:46:06,040 --> 00:46:09,519
so they can have a chance to
win when they are outnumbered.

384
00:46:10,000 --> 00:46:12,519
We will not help them.

385
00:46:43,000 --> 00:46:47,039
What's the hurry, Turk?
We are here to decapitate you.

386
00:46:47,040 --> 00:46:49,519
We spared you the energy.

387
00:46:57,000 --> 00:47:00,039
So you will decapitate us huh?

388
00:47:19,000 --> 00:47:23,039
Pray that I promised my father not to kill you.

389
00:47:23,480 --> 00:47:27,039
Or it would be your head instead of your hand.

390
00:47:29,480 --> 00:47:32,039
You dog.

391
00:47:32,480 --> 00:47:37,039
My Shahzade, we killed them
all. We've won thanks to Allah.

392
00:47:37,040 --> 00:47:41,039
Thank Allah. Alps, I will
take this dog to my father.

393
00:47:41,480 --> 00:47:44,519
You gather the banners and clothes.

394
00:47:45,000 --> 00:47:47,039
We will use them later.

395
00:47:47,040 --> 00:47:49,519
-As you command, my Shahzade.
-Come on.

396
00:47:53,480 --> 00:47:56,039
On your feet!

397
00:48:18,480 --> 00:48:22,519
-Tell me, commander.
-What do you want to know?

398
00:48:22,520 --> 00:48:26,039
How many Catalans are there in your encampment?

399
00:48:26,480 --> 00:48:29,519
More than two thousand, for now.

400
00:48:30,000 --> 00:48:33,039
Around ten thousand more is on its way.

401
00:48:33,040 --> 00:48:38,039
-What is their route?
-Their route is your land.

402
00:48:38,040 --> 00:48:41,039
Is that so.

403
00:48:46,000 --> 00:48:48,519
Bring him back!

404
00:48:58,480 --> 00:49:01,519
Now tell me, what is their route?.

405
00:49:01,520 --> 00:49:06,519
They have two options. If
your land is not safe enough...

406
00:49:06,520 --> 00:49:09,519
..they will meet with Olcaytu by travelling on sea.

407
00:49:10,000 --> 00:49:12,519
Who says our lands are safe?

408
00:49:12,520 --> 00:49:15,039
Tell me?

409
00:49:15,480 --> 00:49:19,519
Cardinal and his men.

410
00:49:19,520 --> 00:49:24,519
-What if they die?
-You can never touch them.

411
00:49:27,480 --> 00:49:30,039
You will not see it.

412
00:49:31,000 --> 00:49:35,039
I told you everything you
want. That is why I will give you..

413
00:49:35,480 --> 00:49:38,519
.. a painless death in return.

414
00:49:50,480 --> 00:49:54,519
-What will we do now, my Bey?
-Banners will stay with us.

415
00:49:54,520 --> 00:49:58,519
After destroying Franks'
headquarters, we'll plant them there

416
00:49:58,520 --> 00:50:02,039
We need to stop this crusader army. Let us leave.

417
00:50:02,480 --> 00:50:06,039
Let us destroy those franks.

418
00:50:06,040 --> 00:50:08,519
As you command, my Bey.

419
00:50:16,480 --> 00:50:21,039
Franks have landed on the
shore. They will move soon.

420
00:50:21,040 --> 00:50:25,039
They will fall under my command after
uniting with Catalans at Harmanustu.

421
00:50:25,480 --> 00:50:29,039
We'll build our first headquarters
at Yakup's marketplace.

422
00:50:29,040 --> 00:50:32,039
Greet the franks, be careful.

423
00:50:36,000 --> 00:50:38,519
Imren Tegin. How much do you trust Osman?

424
00:50:38,520 --> 00:50:43,039
I do not trust anyone but myself, Cardinal.

425
00:50:44,480 --> 00:50:48,519
However, do not worry,
Osman’s leash is in my hands.

426
00:50:58,480 --> 00:51:00,039
Imren Tegin, Holofira.

427
00:51:00,040 --> 00:51:03,519
She is executed.
Olivia is still on her duty.

428
00:51:04,000 --> 00:51:08,519
What disorder this is? She
sacrificed herself for nothing.

429
00:51:09,000 --> 00:51:14,039
The letter must've reached Olivia by now.

430
00:51:14,040 --> 00:51:16,519
They will learn Holofira was innocent.

431
00:51:16,520 --> 00:51:18,519
Killing an innocent..

432
00:51:18,520 --> 00:51:22,039
What a tragedy. It is such a tragedy that..

433
00:51:22,040 --> 00:51:27,519
Orhan will hold his father
accountable for his love for Holofira.

434
00:51:27,520 --> 00:51:33,039
Only love can destroy a
relationship between father and son.

435
00:51:45,480 --> 00:51:47,039
-Kanyumaz.
-My Bey.

436
00:51:47,040 --> 00:51:51,519
-Are you alright?
-Thank Allah, my Bey.

437
00:51:55,480 --> 00:51:59,039
So it was all a trick.

438
00:51:59,040 --> 00:52:02,519
So you say Osman Bey is doing a new trick.

439
00:52:04,000 --> 00:52:08,519
He gave the marketplace
away to set a trap to Imren.

440
00:52:09,000 --> 00:52:12,039
You still don't trust us.

441
00:52:16,000 --> 00:52:20,039
Kite stronghold was attacked.
We were keeping it a secret.

442
00:52:20,040 --> 00:52:23,039
The attacker is still unknown.

443
00:52:24,000 --> 00:52:29,039
That is why we didn't say anything to anyone.

444
00:52:32,000 --> 00:52:38,039
Mehmed Bey. I trusted you and released your alps.

445
00:52:38,480 --> 00:52:42,519
-Do not make any mistake.
-Do not worry, Alaeddin Bey.

446
00:52:42,520 --> 00:52:46,039
I do not attack that dog before gathering my alps.

447
00:52:46,480 --> 00:52:52,039
Alright. Still, do not show your intentions.

448
00:52:52,480 --> 00:52:56,039
We still don't know who Imren's spy is.

449
00:52:56,040 --> 00:53:00,039
I do not host a traitor.

450
00:53:01,000 --> 00:53:04,519
You stay loyal to your cause.

451
00:53:06,000 --> 00:53:11,039
Gonca, you can not reach Kutayha after this.

452
00:53:12,480 --> 00:53:16,519
You go back to Osman Bey's tribe.

453
00:53:17,480 --> 00:53:21,039
I will gather my alps at once.

454
00:53:21,040 --> 00:53:23,519
Alright, brother.

455
00:53:26,000 --> 00:53:29,519
I will be waiting, Gonca Hatun

456
00:53:33,480 --> 00:53:36,039
Gonca.

457
00:53:36,480 --> 00:53:40,519
I wanted you to go back
because there is no other way.

458
00:53:42,000 --> 00:53:45,039
Do not forget that you are engaged.

459
00:53:45,040 --> 00:53:49,039
How shall I forget the fire that has
been burning inside me, brother?

460
00:54:11,000 --> 00:54:14,039
-Kanyumaz.
-My Bey.

461
00:54:15,000 --> 00:54:19,039
Alaaddin was right. We need to be more careful.

462
00:54:19,480 --> 00:54:22,039
Imren's spies can be anywhere.

463
00:54:22,480 --> 00:54:27,039
If he finds out we'll take the market with
Kayi people, things will be harder for us.

464
00:54:27,480 --> 00:54:30,519
As you order, my Bey.

465
00:54:55,000 --> 00:54:58,519
I couldn't tell you the truth because...

466
00:54:58,520 --> 00:55:02,519
It was a state matter, right?

467
00:55:03,480 --> 00:55:06,519
I wasn't expecting otherwise, anyway.

468
00:55:09,000 --> 00:55:11,519
Trickster Hatun.

469
00:55:12,480 --> 00:55:15,519
I have nothing left to hide from you anymore.

470
00:55:15,520 --> 00:55:18,519
Alaaddin Bey.

471
00:55:19,000 --> 00:55:23,039
No need for this.
You did the right thing.

472
00:55:23,040 --> 00:55:28,519
I mean it. You seem to have
forgotten but I'm telling you.

473
00:55:30,000 --> 00:55:32,519
It's over.

474
00:55:36,000 --> 00:55:39,039
It doesn't matter anymore..

475
00:55:48,000 --> 00:55:51,039
It's over, huh?

476
00:55:54,000 --> 00:55:57,039
It's over?

477
00:56:03,000 --> 00:56:08,519
Fine. Shall we have the
race that you promised then?

478
00:56:11,480 --> 00:56:17,039
Fine. This shall be the last race.

479
00:56:18,000 --> 00:56:22,039
Only Allah can know that.

480
00:56:29,000 --> 00:56:31,519
Come on.

481
00:56:47,000 --> 00:56:50,039
You are my best.

482
00:56:51,000 --> 00:56:53,519
Test Hatun.

483
00:56:54,000 --> 00:56:56,519
Come on!

484
00:57:21,480 --> 00:57:25,039
-Let's go!
-Let's go!

485
00:57:58,000 --> 00:58:01,039
-Let's go!
-Let's go!

486
00:58:03,000 --> 00:58:05,519
NEAR FRANK HEADQUARTERS

487
00:58:07,480 --> 00:58:11,519
We'll advance quickly as far as we can.

488
00:58:42,480 --> 00:58:46,039
Come on.

489
00:59:56,000 --> 01:00:00,039
Be quiet, alps.
Don't let your steps...

490
01:00:00,040 --> 01:00:03,519
...even scare the ants.

491
01:00:06,000 --> 01:00:08,519
Come on.

492
01:00:22,480 --> 01:00:26,519
This is the first land I’ve taken from Turks.

493
01:00:27,000 --> 01:00:31,039
For this reason, the defense should be epic.

494
01:00:31,040 --> 01:00:34,039
Kanyumaz told us about
the weak spots of the market.

495
01:00:34,040 --> 01:00:37,519
We're repairing them and
reinforcing the walls, Imren Tegin.

496
01:00:38,480 --> 01:00:42,519
Kanyumaz... That poor man isn't around.

497
01:00:43,000 --> 01:00:45,519
It means Osman's alps killed him.

498
01:00:46,000 --> 01:00:49,519
Be careful. Germiyan will attempt to do something.

499
01:00:49,520 --> 01:00:53,519
So be it. They can attack if they want to die.

500
01:00:55,480 --> 01:00:58,519
Finish the preparations as soon as possible.

501
01:00:58,520 --> 01:01:02,039
This will be the headquarters
of Franks and Catalans.

502
01:01:02,480 --> 01:01:06,519
They will join Crusaders here
and march to Konya afterwards.

503
01:01:07,000 --> 01:01:10,039
What about the messengers?

504
01:01:10,040 --> 01:01:13,519
We'll bring them here when things settle down.

505
01:01:19,480 --> 01:01:22,519
Everything is ready for my state.

506
01:01:22,520 --> 01:01:26,039
Benjamin is going to bring
Franks and Catalans here.

507
01:01:26,480 --> 01:01:30,039
When I get my Seljuk sings from Osman,

508
01:01:30,480 --> 01:01:33,519
...nobody can stand against me.

509
01:02:28,000 --> 01:02:31,519
Alllah is the greatest.

510
01:02:37,000 --> 01:02:40,519
Come on, alps. Come on, alps!

511
01:02:42,480 --> 01:02:45,039
-Come on.
-Come on.

512
01:02:45,480 --> 01:02:49,039
You can pass through lands of
Turks neither today nor tomorrow!

513
01:02:49,040 --> 01:02:52,039
-Allah is the greatest!
-Allah is the greatest!

514
01:02:52,480 --> 01:02:55,039
O Allah!

515
01:04:45,000 --> 01:04:49,519
We've missed fighting back
to back, haven't we, brother?

516
01:04:50,480 --> 01:04:53,039
Yes, brother! For sure!

517
01:05:01,000 --> 01:05:05,519
We're not done yet. Stop talking and fight.

518
01:05:23,000 --> 01:05:27,039
Be careful, Boran. Don't stand
like a scarecrow behind Osman Bey.

519
01:05:27,040 --> 01:05:30,039
Watch his back well.

520
01:05:35,480 --> 01:05:38,519
Alright, brother.

521
01:06:00,000 --> 01:06:02,039
As long as there are jackals like you,

522
01:06:02,040 --> 01:06:06,519
...we will always stand like
mountain chains against you.

523
01:06:06,520 --> 01:06:11,519
You can't get out in these
lands and even these forests!

524
01:06:12,000 --> 01:06:16,039
Today you, tomorrow all of you.

525
01:06:16,040 --> 01:06:20,039
You will get out of these lands

526
01:06:28,480 --> 01:06:34,039
When Imren Tegin hears about this,
he will be truly surprised, Osman Bey.

527
01:06:34,480 --> 01:06:39,039
Betrayal begins where interests finish, Gunduz Bey.

528
01:06:39,040 --> 01:06:42,519
You will see. Imren Tegin...

529
01:06:42,520 --> 01:06:45,519
...will just ignore Catalans.

530
01:06:47,000 --> 01:06:52,519
Well... Well...

531
01:07:00,480 --> 01:07:05,519
My alps! My Beys!

532
01:07:06,480 --> 01:07:09,519
Migrating will end one day.

533
01:07:09,520 --> 01:07:13,039
Darkness will reach light one day!

534
01:07:13,040 --> 01:07:17,519
I'm Osman Bey
and I will never...

535
01:07:17,520 --> 01:07:21,519
...let the cruel prevail in these lands!

536
01:07:22,000 --> 01:07:23,039
I swear to you!

537
01:07:23,040 --> 01:07:29,039
We sweari We swear!
We swear! We swear!

538
01:07:29,480 --> 01:07:35,039
My enemies should be sure of this.

539
01:07:41,480 --> 01:07:44,519
As long as I breathe,

540
01:07:47,000 --> 01:07:51,519
...justice will last forever, so will freedom!

541
01:07:51,520 --> 01:07:54,519
Allah is the gretest!
Allah is the gretest!

542
01:07:54,520 --> 01:07:59,519
-Allah is the gretest! Allah is the gretest!
-Allah is the gretest! Allah is the gretest!

543
01:07:59,520 --> 01:08:04,039
-Allah is the gretest!
-Allah is the gretest!

544
01:08:32,479 --> 01:08:35,037
What happened here?

545
01:08:43,479 --> 01:08:46,037
My Frank brother...

546
01:09:03,000 --> 01:09:09,037
Catalans! Damn!
Catalans! They betrayed us!

547
01:09:09,479 --> 01:09:15,519
Imren Tegin will get mad after
learning this! We are leaving!

548
01:09:48,479 --> 01:09:51,037
Brother...

549
01:10:11,000 --> 01:10:15,519
Brothers... Will you continue this?

550
01:10:16,000 --> 01:10:18,519
I think he doesn't have the face to do it.

551
01:10:19,000 --> 01:10:21,039
He will shut up with his decency.

552
01:10:21,040 --> 01:10:24,039
If I speak, I will break
bones, not just hearts, brother.

553
01:10:24,040 --> 01:10:27,039
That's why I am not speaking.
-Brother...

554
01:10:31,480 --> 01:10:34,519
My Bey is coming.
He'll notice it.

555
01:10:34,520 --> 01:10:39,519
Then we'll be in trouble. Stop fighting.

556
01:10:54,480 --> 01:10:57,519
We gained a great victory, huh, Osman Bey?

557
01:10:57,520 --> 01:11:00,039
No...

558
01:11:00,040 --> 01:11:03,039
This is not a great victory for us.

559
01:11:04,480 --> 01:11:08,519
We only broke the crusaders' pawns.

560
01:11:09,000 --> 01:11:14,039
But the actual issue is the Catalans
who built a headquarters in our lands.

561
01:11:14,040 --> 01:11:17,519
And messengers who are
bringing Crusaders to our lands.

562
01:11:17,520 --> 01:11:20,039
We need their heads.

563
01:11:20,480 --> 01:11:24,519
I don't think we can find Catalans.

564
01:11:25,000 --> 01:11:31,519
How are we going to get rid of
those messengers, Osman Bey?

565
01:11:32,000 --> 01:11:36,039
They are not leaving Atranos.
And we cannot besiege it again.

566
01:11:36,480 --> 01:11:40,039
Wait, Gunduz Bey... Wait.

567
01:11:40,040 --> 01:11:44,519
Is Imren Tegin our enemy?
Why would we besiege his castle?

568
01:11:49,000 --> 01:11:53,039
Imren will think that Catalans killed the Franks.

569
01:11:56,480 --> 01:12:00,039
Someone is coming, my Bey.

570
01:12:01,480 --> 01:12:06,519
My Bey. Benjamin came, he saw the situation.

571
01:12:06,520 --> 01:12:10,039
They will think Catalans did it.
-Yes.

572
01:12:10,040 --> 01:12:13,039
This is the news we were expecting.

573
01:12:13,040 --> 01:12:18,039
Catalans will now be Imren's enemies.

574
01:12:20,000 --> 01:12:23,039
Tell me... Tell me now..

575
01:12:23,040 --> 01:12:26,039
Who will help Imren?

576
01:12:26,480 --> 01:12:29,519
There's no one left beside us
who will support him, my Bey.

577
01:12:30,000 --> 01:12:33,519
Right. He will even take us to the Catalans.

578
01:12:33,520 --> 01:12:37,519
We will fight together, side by side.

579
01:12:39,480 --> 01:12:43,039
Now... after taking the heads of the messengers..

580
01:12:43,480 --> 01:12:46,519
...neither the Pope nor the
Western states will support Imren.

581
01:12:48,480 --> 01:12:55,039
This way, the Crusader army will
stop before it even makes a move.

582
01:12:57,000 --> 01:12:59,519
Otherwise...

583
01:13:00,480 --> 01:13:04,039
...Imren will attack like a mad dog.

584
01:13:04,040 --> 01:13:09,039
Then Kite and the tribes will be targeted.

585
01:13:09,480 --> 01:13:14,519
That's why, Gunduz Bey, the protection
of these lands is your responsibility.

586
01:13:17,480 --> 01:13:22,039
Come on now Alps, valiants.
We are going to Atranos.

587
01:13:22,040 --> 01:13:27,039
So... Let's help Imren Tegin, huh?

588
01:13:29,000 --> 01:13:33,039
Imren... Come on.

589
01:13:51,000 --> 01:13:58,519
Gonca... Are you really going to
marry that man who you don't know?

590
01:14:00,480 --> 01:14:06,039
I have to, Fatma.
I just have to.

591
01:14:06,480 --> 01:14:12,039
You don't. You don’t, Gonca. There must be a way

592
01:14:19,000 --> 01:14:22,039
Alaeddin Bey.

593
01:14:27,000 --> 01:14:31,519
-What are you doing here?
-I am tired.

594
01:14:32,000 --> 01:14:35,039
You can continue. -Fatma.

595
01:14:48,000 --> 01:14:51,519
What do you want?
Trickster Hatun. I...

596
01:14:53,480 --> 01:14:57,519
I said it's over, Alaeddin Bey. It's over.

597
01:14:57,520 --> 01:15:04,039
Don't force it anymore. Come on. Please go.

598
01:15:05,480 --> 01:15:10,039
Gonca... Listen to me first.

599
01:15:11,480 --> 01:15:16,519
I know I hurt you today. But...

600
01:15:17,480 --> 01:15:20,039
...am new to this love.

601
01:15:20,480 --> 01:15:25,039
Tell me... What should I do? How
can I make you forgive me, huh?

602
01:15:29,480 --> 01:15:37,039
You’ve hurt me many times, Alaeddin. But I
got used to being the one who is not trusted.

603
01:15:37,480 --> 01:15:42,039
I am not mad at you. I am not mad at your family.

604
01:15:42,040 --> 01:15:47,519
Our families will never
be able to trust each other.

605
01:15:48,480 --> 01:15:52,039
-That’s not true.
-That's true.

606
01:15:53,480 --> 01:15:58,039
We lost each other's trust.
-Don't my rose. -Alaeddin...

607
01:15:58,480 --> 01:16:02,039
-Don’t, Gonca.
-Alaeddin.

608
01:16:03,480 --> 01:16:06,519
No matter what you say, that's the truth.

609
01:16:08,000 --> 01:16:10,519
What can we do?

610
01:16:11,480 --> 01:16:14,519
This is the end of our fairy tale.
-Don't.

611
01:16:15,000 --> 01:16:19,039
Alaeddin... Don't!

612
01:16:23,000 --> 01:16:26,039
I promised someone.

613
01:16:29,480 --> 01:16:33,519
You were not the one who promised, Gonca.
-My father's promise...

614
01:16:33,520 --> 01:16:36,519
...is my promise.

615
01:16:37,000 --> 01:16:40,519
Like your brother Orhan Bey...

616
01:16:42,000 --> 01:16:44,519
...have to do this.

617
01:16:51,000 --> 01:16:55,519
Don't go. -Safely.

618
01:16:56,000 --> 01:16:59,519
Gonca! Wait.

619
01:17:17,480 --> 01:17:21,039
I had this made for you.

620
01:17:27,000 --> 01:17:31,519
I am telling you that I am engaged.
Please, don't do this. Please.

621
01:17:44,480 --> 01:17:47,519
Then let it be a remembrance.

622
01:17:49,480 --> 01:17:55,519
May you smile every time you
look in this mirror, Coy Hatun.

623
01:18:11,480 --> 01:18:14,039
What do you think you’re doing?

624
01:18:14,480 --> 01:18:16,519
-Gonca is betrothed.
-Mother.

625
01:18:16,520 --> 01:18:20,519
-I’m in pain, I don't know what I'm doing.
-Alaeddin.

626
01:18:21,000 --> 01:18:25,519
Gonca is right.
Don't cross her path.

627
01:18:25,520 --> 01:18:28,039
It is a dangerous path, son.

628
01:18:28,040 --> 01:18:31,039
-This path would make Turkmens kill each other.
-Don't do it mother.

629
01:18:31,040 --> 01:18:33,039
-Don't do it.
-What, Alaeddin?

630
01:18:33,040 --> 01:18:37,519
You will seal your heart like your brother, got it?

631
01:18:38,000 --> 01:18:41,519
You have no choice.

632
01:18:52,000 --> 01:18:55,519
My Allah, give me strength.

633
01:18:56,000 --> 01:18:59,039
Give me strength, my Allah.

634
01:19:23,000 --> 01:19:26,039
Imren Tegin.

635
01:19:27,000 --> 01:19:31,519
What happened, why is your face like that?

636
01:19:32,480 --> 01:19:37,519
-Where are the Franks?
-They are dead.

637
01:19:40,000 --> 01:19:45,039
-Catalans attacked them.
-Catalans?

638
01:19:46,000 --> 01:19:51,039
Why would they attack? Why
would they stab us in the back?

639
01:19:53,480 --> 01:19:57,519
Oh my God. What are we going to do now?

640
01:19:59,000 --> 01:20:02,519
This attack will wound The Crusaders’ unity.

641
01:20:03,480 --> 01:20:10,039
We have to be strong. If not,
neither Olcaytu nor Pope will trust us.

642
01:20:11,480 --> 01:20:18,039
Then my dream of a state in Quds
would be gone. I can't let this happen.

643
01:20:19,480 --> 01:20:25,039
We will destroy Catalans before
Turks hear about this treason.

644
01:20:25,040 --> 01:20:30,039
Send your men to find the traces of Catalans.

645
01:20:37,000 --> 01:20:41,519
Imren Tegin. Osman is coming
to the castle with his men.

646
01:20:42,000 --> 01:20:44,519
Osman?

647
01:20:48,480 --> 01:20:53,519
-Did he hear about the treason?
-I don't trust Osman at all.

648
01:20:53,520 --> 01:20:57,519
He will take credit for this treason.

649
01:20:58,000 --> 01:21:03,519
His credit will be death sooner or later, Cardinal.

650
01:21:04,000 --> 01:21:08,039
Let's see what Osman wants.

651
01:21:35,480 --> 01:21:38,519
Where are you Imren?

652
01:21:38,520 --> 01:21:41,519
Where are you? Show yourself!

653
01:22:42,000 --> 01:22:45,519
Welcome, Osman Bey.

654
01:22:47,000 --> 01:22:51,039
Did you kill my men around Taspinar?

655
01:22:52,480 --> 01:22:57,039
Who else but you would draw
sword against me in these lands?

656
01:22:57,480 --> 01:23:00,519
Why would I kill the soldiers of my ally?

657
01:23:00,520 --> 01:23:03,519
What about those dastards you brought with you?

658
01:23:04,000 --> 01:23:08,519
Do you keep those dogs on a tight leash?

659
01:23:10,000 --> 01:23:13,519
Their teeth touched my soldiers.

660
01:23:16,000 --> 01:23:20,519
There are some people, Osman Bey.

661
01:23:21,000 --> 01:23:23,519
Who?

662
01:23:30,480 --> 01:23:33,519
Catalans.

663
01:23:40,000 --> 01:23:43,039
Why would...

664
01:23:44,000 --> 01:23:47,039
...Catalans be against you?

665
01:23:47,040 --> 01:23:49,768
They killed the Frank
units first, they destroyed

666
01:23:49,780 --> 01:23:52,519
the warriors that are very
important to Crusaders.

667
01:23:52,520 --> 01:23:56,039
They damaged the Crusade a lot.

668
01:23:57,000 --> 01:24:01,039
I'll destroy them.

669
01:24:02,000 --> 01:24:05,039
Look at me.

670
01:24:05,040 --> 01:24:09,039
You invited Catalans to these lands.

671
01:24:09,480 --> 01:24:14,039
If something happens, I'll make you pay for it.

672
01:24:14,480 --> 01:24:19,519
If you become my ally, you
will not hide anything from me.

673
01:24:20,480 --> 01:24:23,519
It is too dangerous to move
while Catalans are rebelling.

674
01:24:23,520 --> 01:24:26,519
What happened, Cardinal?

675
01:24:27,480 --> 01:24:32,519
You were brave enough when
you came here to declare war?

676
01:24:33,480 --> 01:24:38,519
Now you started to talk when
it is about your own soldiers.

677
01:24:39,000 --> 01:24:41,519
What happened?

678
01:24:44,000 --> 01:24:50,039
You started hesitating when
the sword is on your neck.

679
01:24:52,480 --> 01:24:58,039
If Catalans are changing sides, very well then.

680
01:25:00,000 --> 01:25:03,519
We'll fight together.

681
01:25:04,480 --> 01:25:09,519
Then these Crusaders will leave my lands.

682
01:25:12,480 --> 01:25:15,519
We will crush the rebels together.

683
01:25:17,000 --> 01:25:21,519
When I find the traces of Catalans I'll
inform you about the time and place.

684
01:25:21,520 --> 01:25:24,039
Find me the den of those dogs.

685
01:25:24,040 --> 01:25:27,519
We will fight by your side.

686
01:25:28,000 --> 01:25:34,039
I wish you chose Christianity
and joined us, Osman Bey.

687
01:25:38,000 --> 01:25:44,519
If you want this to be a long-lasting alliance,

688
01:25:47,000 --> 01:25:51,039
then you will need to convert to Islam.

689
01:25:54,480 --> 01:25:58,519
You will be the soldier of The Creator,
otherwise it will be over with this thing.

690
01:25:59,000 --> 01:26:03,039
You're inviting me to Islam in
the middle of Crusader army.

691
01:26:03,480 --> 01:26:07,519
Even if we are alone, our voices
are loud. What about the Crusaders?

692
01:26:08,000 --> 01:26:11,039
What are they?

693
01:26:18,000 --> 01:26:22,039
Then let's do it your way.

694
01:26:22,480 --> 01:26:27,039
You will keep your religion, and I will keep mine.

695
01:26:29,000 --> 01:26:32,519
Then it will be as we agreed on.

696
01:26:33,000 --> 01:26:37,039
Until one of us dies, Osman Bey.

697
01:26:42,480 --> 01:26:45,519
Until one of us dies.

698
01:27:08,000 --> 01:27:10,519
Come on.

699
01:27:34,480 --> 01:27:38,039
It's from Imren Tegin. It's very confidential.

700
01:27:38,480 --> 01:27:41,519
What's going on in the tribe?
I don't know about anything.

701
01:27:41,520 --> 01:27:44,519
They're working for Orhan and Elcim's marriage.

702
01:27:44,520 --> 01:27:47,519
They don't talk about it openly.

703
01:27:53,480 --> 01:27:58,039
Kill the spy. Blame her for Holofira's crime.

704
01:27:58,480 --> 01:28:03,519
Orhan will be Osman's enemy when he realizes
that Holofira was killed as an innocent.

705
01:28:04,000 --> 01:28:08,039
Hide the other letter on the spy.

706
01:28:10,000 --> 01:28:14,039
It should be good news since you're smiling.

707
01:28:16,000 --> 01:28:19,039
One more person will die in the tribe.

708
01:28:19,040 --> 01:28:21,519
Who?

709
01:28:34,000 --> 01:28:36,519
You.

710
01:29:59,000 --> 01:30:03,039
-May it be easy, hatuns.
-Thank you Malhun Hatun.

711
01:30:03,480 --> 01:30:06,519
Welcome, you did well.

712
01:30:09,000 --> 01:30:12,039
It looks great, Ulgen.

713
01:30:13,000 --> 01:30:16,039
Try it so we can make the necessary adjustments.

714
01:30:16,480 --> 01:30:21,039
-Let’s give it a try.
-Hold it like this.

715
01:30:21,480 --> 01:30:25,039
Right, let's see it on you.

716
01:30:25,040 --> 01:30:28,519
It looks great, thank you.

717
01:30:32,480 --> 01:30:36,039
Hold it as well.

718
01:30:43,000 --> 01:30:45,519
You look great, daughter.

719
01:30:45,520 --> 01:30:48,519
-Da you like it?
-Mother!

720
01:30:49,000 --> 01:30:51,519
Mother, mother.

721
01:30:52,480 --> 01:30:54,039
-What happened, daughter?
-Hilal.

722
01:30:54,040 --> 01:30:59,519
She went Olivia Hatun's tent. Alps
said it, but she went there secretly

723
01:31:00,000 --> 01:31:03,519
She tried to trick them to get there.

724
01:31:06,000 --> 01:31:10,519
There's something wrong with this, come on.

725
01:31:17,480 --> 01:31:20,519
Murderer! Murderer!

726
01:31:21,000 --> 01:31:25,039
She tried to kill me! Murderer!

727
01:31:28,000 --> 01:31:31,519
-Murderer!
-My lady!

728
01:31:33,000 --> 01:31:35,519
-Help!
-Olivia!

729
01:31:36,000 --> 01:31:39,519
Olivia, what happened?

730
01:31:41,000 --> 01:31:46,519
She got in the tent and attacked me!

731
01:31:47,000 --> 01:31:50,039
Told me Imren Tegin won't leave me alive!

732
01:31:50,040 --> 01:31:53,519
That it is my
turn after Holofira.

733
01:31:54,480 --> 01:31:59,519
I almost got killed. I killed her.

734
01:32:04,480 --> 01:32:11,519
Ladies, take Lal out of the
tent, we will search her, come on!

735
01:32:15,000 --> 01:32:19,519
So you say it was Lal who poisoned Elcim.

736
01:32:27,000 --> 01:32:32,519
I told you. I told you all!

737
01:32:34,480 --> 01:32:38,039
Holofira wouldn't do such a thing!

738
01:32:43,000 --> 01:32:45,519
She died for nothing.

739
01:32:49,480 --> 01:32:54,039
Was Holofira innocent?

740
01:32:55,000 --> 01:32:57,519
Did we do her wrong?

741
01:33:07,000 --> 01:33:12,039
My niece has died because of Imren Tegin's tricks.

742
01:33:14,000 --> 01:33:17,039
Then why did she take the blame?

743
01:33:18,480 --> 01:33:21,039
Why?

744
01:33:21,480 --> 01:33:26,519
Why do you think? To save me!

745
01:33:26,520 --> 01:33:30,519
She knew you would blame me!

746
01:33:30,520 --> 01:33:35,519
She sacrificed herself! The
love-sickness had already killed her!

747
01:33:36,480 --> 01:33:41,519
She was Innocenti Innocent!

748
01:34:06,000 --> 01:34:09,039
Osman Bey is coming!

749
01:34:18,000 --> 01:34:24,039
-Long live Osman Bey!
-Long live Osman Bey!

750
01:34:25,000 --> 01:34:30,039
Thank you. May your feast be plenty.

751
01:34:30,040 --> 01:34:33,519
Enjoy, come on alps.

752
01:34:37,000 --> 01:34:40,039
May your feast be plenty.

753
01:34:44,000 --> 01:34:47,039
Enjoy.

754
01:34:48,000 --> 01:34:53,039
Thanks, thanks.

755
01:34:57,480 --> 01:35:00,039
May you prosper.

756
01:35:08,480 --> 01:35:13,039
-Welcome, Osman Bey.
-I feel welcomed.

757
01:35:16,480 --> 01:35:19,039
-Praise be, you look well.
-Yes.

758
01:35:20,000 --> 01:35:23,519
I hope you brought good news, my Bey.

759
01:35:23,520 --> 01:35:28,519
We did indeed. Let us go to
the hall, I've things to tell you.

760
01:35:42,480 --> 01:35:45,039
This hunt must be important.

761
01:35:45,480 --> 01:35:49,039
-Looking at how joyful they seem.
-This is not a hunt.

762
01:35:49,480 --> 01:35:54,039
There is something elsfe. I will learn for sure.

763
01:35:55,480 --> 01:35:59,039
However, the important thing
is learning Osman's trust now.

764
01:35:59,480 --> 01:36:05,039
-How will we do that, my Lady?
-I've already started, Andra.

765
01:36:05,480 --> 01:36:09,519
The death of Lal will be the proof of my innocence.

766
01:36:12,480 --> 01:36:15,039
My Bey, this was found on Lal.

767
01:36:15,040 --> 01:36:19,519
She was with Imren Tegin, however,
we think she was also with Olivia.

768
01:36:22,000 --> 01:36:28,519
Kill Olivia after Holofira.

769
01:36:31,000 --> 01:36:35,519
Whoever stands against
Imren Tegin will pay the price.

770
01:36:35,520 --> 01:36:41,039
So she killed Lal to shut her up.

771
01:36:50,000 --> 01:36:53,039
Their intention was to
disrupt our union from the start.

772
01:36:53,040 --> 01:36:56,519
She did not hesitate sacrificing Holofira.

773
01:36:57,480 --> 01:37:01,519
They do not. However..

774
01:37:02,000 --> 01:37:05,039
..they will pay for what
they've done to Holofira and us.

775
01:37:06,000 --> 01:37:10,519
It seems Lal was sending
letters to Olivia and Imren.

776
01:37:10,520 --> 01:37:15,039
Now, Lal is dead. She can
not message Imren anymore.

777
01:37:15,040 --> 01:37:18,039
Imren will surely send her a letter, my Bey.

778
01:37:18,040 --> 01:37:20,039
-Alaeddin.
-My Bey.

779
01:37:20,040 --> 01:37:24,519
You will tell those who
follow Olivia to be careful.

780
01:37:24,520 --> 01:37:29,039
Olivia will open the doors of Abranos to us.

781
01:37:29,040 --> 01:37:34,039
-As you command, my Bey.
-Bala, Malhun.

782
01:37:36,000 --> 01:37:38,519
You will earn her trust.

783
01:37:38,520 --> 01:37:43,519
As long as she trusts you,
she will surely message Imren.

784
01:37:44,000 --> 01:37:46,519
As you command, my Bey.

785
01:37:53,480 --> 01:37:56,519
Are you sure you want to fight alongside Osman?

786
01:38:01,000 --> 01:38:07,039
I will not waste the rest of my
soldiers to get rid of Catalans, Cardinal.

787
01:38:08,000 --> 01:38:14,039
Don't worry. I will use Osman as a bridge.

788
01:38:24,480 --> 01:38:29,039
Imren Tegin. The location-of
Catalans has been found.

789
01:38:29,040 --> 01:38:32,039
-Where are those dogs?
They are settled near Karanlikdere.

790
01:38:32,480 --> 01:38:36,519
They are being prepared to depart.

791
01:38:36,520 --> 01:38:39,519
So they are being prepared.

792
01:38:40,000 --> 01:38:45,519
Inform Osman at once. We
will hunt Catalans tomorrow.

793
01:38:52,000 --> 01:38:58,039
This is from my Bey’s own pouch.
They will be given to those in need.

794
01:38:58,480 --> 01:39:01,519
Be sure that no one will be left aided.

795
01:39:01,520 --> 01:39:04,519
And no one must know these
supplies came from Osman Bey.

796
01:39:05,000 --> 01:39:07,519
As you command, my,Bey.

797
01:39:09,480 --> 01:39:12,039
-Oguz.
-My Bey.

798
01:39:12,480 --> 01:39:16,519
Come here, brother.

799
01:39:24,480 --> 01:39:26,519
You will go to each merchant.

800
01:39:26,520 --> 01:39:31,039
You will find out who owes to who and pay them all.

801
01:39:32,000 --> 01:39:35,519
Take this.

802
01:39:35,520 --> 01:39:39,519
-If someone asks who are you..
-I am no one, my Bey.

803
01:39:41,000 --> 01:39:43,519
-Come on.
-As you command, my Bey.

804
01:39:46,480 --> 01:39:50,039
Come on.

805
01:40:00,480 --> 01:40:03,039
-Boran Bey.
-My brother.

806
01:40:03,040 --> 01:40:07,039
Why don't you play us a
song while waiting for iftar..

807
01:40:08,480 --> 01:40:11,519
..so that our hearts may find joy?

808
01:40:12,000 --> 01:40:16,039
Of course, my brother. Come on then.

809
01:40:18,000 --> 01:40:20,519
Come on, brothers.

810
01:40:21,480 --> 01:40:24,039
In the name of Allah

811
01:40:40,480 --> 01:41:08,519
I found myself in the sea of Muhammed love.

812
01:41:08,520 --> 01:41:35,039
That is why I am in love with Muhammed.

813
01:41:35,040 --> 01:41:40,039
I found myself in the sea of Muhammed love

814
01:41:40,480 --> 01:41:46,039
That is why I am in love with Muhammed.

815
01:41:46,040 --> 01:41:51,039
The one who is in the community
of the prophet will always be thankful

816
01:41:51,480 --> 01:41:57,039
So, turn me into a lover of Mohammed, my Allah.

817
01:42:02,000 --> 01:42:07,519
Allah put the love of Muhammed in my heart.

818
01:42:07,520 --> 01:42:17,039
I found myself in the sea of Muhammed love

819
01:42:17,040 --> 01:42:17,999
I found myself in the sea of Muhammed love

820
01:42:18,000 --> 01:42:23,519
That is why I am in love with Muhammed.

821
01:42:29,000 --> 01:42:34,039
Like Mecnun, I'd pierce
through mountains for my love

822
01:42:34,480 --> 01:42:40,039
Drive me mad in love like Muhammed

823
01:42:45,000 --> 01:42:50,519
He was always faithful, not cheeky.

824
01:42:50,520 --> 01:42:55,519
You're the reason why Muhammed was thankful

825
01:42:56,000 --> 01:43:01,039
I found myself in the sea of Muhammed love

826
01:43:01,040 --> 01:43:06,519
That is why I am in love with Muhammed.

827
01:43:17,480 --> 01:43:22,519
He valued his community all the time.

828
01:43:23,000 --> 01:43:28,519
He is the one whose path can save you in doomsday.

829
01:43:33,480 --> 01:43:38,519
I'm in deep tight love, my Allah

830
01:43:39,000 --> 01:43:44,039
Fulfill my heart like Muhammed

831
01:43:44,040 --> 01:43:49,519
I found myself in the sea of Muhammed love

832
01:43:49,520 --> 01:43:55,119
That is why I am in love with Muhammed.

833
01:44:05,520 --> 01:44:11,039
Hero with a darkened face he was.

834
01:44:11,040 --> 01:44:17,039
Wish I could see him even for a moment.

835
01:44:21,480 --> 01:44:27,039
Everybody is desiring to meet him.

836
01:44:27,040 --> 01:44:32,519
When am I going to be honoured to see him?

837
01:44:32,520 --> 01:44:37,559
I found myself in the sea of Muhammed love

838
01:44:38,000 --> 01:44:43,039
That is why I am in love with Muhammed.

839
01:44:43,480 --> 01:44:48,519
I found myself in the sea of Muhammed love

840
01:44:48,520 --> 01:44:54,519
That is why I am in love with Muhammed.

841
01:44:58,000 --> 01:45:04,039
-Thank you, Boran Bey.
-Eyvallah, brother.

842
01:45:06,000 --> 01:45:09,039
I see what’s going to happen, Scholar.

843
01:45:10,000 --> 01:45:14,039
Your family will never trust me as before.

844
01:45:14,480 --> 01:45:18,039
I know this. And so...

845
01:45:19,000 --> 01:45:23,039
... accepting marrying a man whom I don't love.

846
01:45:27,480 --> 01:45:32,519
You're also marrying a man whom
you don't love and who may not love you?

847
01:45:33,000 --> 01:45:36,519
Ha, Gonca Hatun?

848
01:45:39,000 --> 01:45:45,039
Whoever you see in this tribe, they want
to be a daughter or a son of Bey, right?

849
01:45:45,480 --> 01:45:50,519
But they don't know about the
burden that title put on our shoulders.

850
01:46:07,000 --> 01:46:11,039
You're right. Our fates are the same.

851
01:46:14,000 --> 01:46:17,039
They aren't the same, Elcim Hatun.

852
01:46:18,000 --> 01:46:21,039
You know the man you're going to marry.

853
01:46:23,480 --> 01:46:27,039
But I have no idea about him.

854
01:46:27,480 --> 01:46:31,039
And... And..

855
01:46:33,480 --> 01:46:37,039
You love someone else.

856
01:46:38,480 --> 01:46:42,039
Then your fate resembles Orhan Bey's.

857
01:46:42,480 --> 01:46:46,039
Talking about this would only
tire our hearts, Elcim Hatun.

858
01:46:46,480 --> 01:46:51,039
-Let me help you.
-They say Holofira was your friend.

859
01:46:55,000 --> 01:46:59,039
Maybe you're angry with me that
I accepted marrying Orhan Bey.

860
01:46:59,480 --> 01:47:04,519
No, Elcim. I know why you two are getting married.

861
01:47:05,000 --> 01:47:09,519
What I'm angry with is that
Holofira got blamed wrongly.

862
01:47:11,000 --> 01:47:15,519
-She was like my sister.
-I didn't want this to happen.

863
01:47:15,520 --> 01:47:20,519
I know you didn't. I heard
what happened in the court.

864
01:47:22,000 --> 01:47:25,039
Let's go. We shouldn't be late for iftar.

865
01:47:26,000 --> 01:47:29,039
Come on.

866
01:47:37,000 --> 01:47:39,519
Lots of stone walls,

867
01:47:39,520 --> 01:47:44,039
..vast gardens and rooms decorated with silk, huh?

868
01:47:45,000 --> 01:47:49,039
No, none of these would please
me as much as this tent, Osman.

869
01:47:49,040 --> 01:47:52,039
You're right, Bala.

870
01:47:52,040 --> 01:47:57,519
I’m glad we came to the
tribe. Everyone is so happy.

871
01:48:00,480 --> 01:48:04,519
Well, Bala... The., plane tree is growing.

872
01:48:04,520 --> 01:48:07,519
Its branches are growing high to the sky.

873
01:48:08,000 --> 01:48:12,039
But the leaves want to reach the
roots. We are something like that.

874
01:48:14,480 --> 01:48:19,519
We had the greatest joys in this tribe.

875
01:48:20,000 --> 01:48:24,039
My first love. My first test.

876
01:48:24,040 --> 01:48:28,519
My first victory.
My first defeat.

877
01:48:28,520 --> 01:48:31,519
I had all of these here.

878
01:48:32,000 --> 01:48:38,519
I want my children to bury their suffering in
this land and cry out their joys to this sky.

879
01:48:40,480 --> 01:48:44,039
-Our children, huh?
-Yes.

880
01:48:46,480 --> 01:48:50,519
They grow up so fast. When I look at them,

881
01:48:51,000 --> 01:48:56,519
...see your mercy in Fatma,
your wisdom in Alaaddin...

882
01:48:56,520 --> 01:49:01,039
...and your strength in Orhan.

883
01:49:04,480 --> 01:49:08,519
They're going through many
hardships for our cause as well.

884
01:49:09,000 --> 01:49:12,519
I know you see that.

885
01:49:14,000 --> 01:49:18,519
I do. Holofira?

886
01:49:19,480 --> 01:49:22,519
-Did you see her? Is she alright?
-She's good.

887
01:49:23,000 --> 01:49:28,039
Trying to stay strong. But the pain in her eyes...

888
01:49:28,480 --> 01:49:33,519
-It's so obvious there.
-Just like Orhan.

889
01:49:35,000 --> 01:49:38,519
I know, Bala. I know about this.

890
01:49:39,000 --> 01:49:42,039
I know Orhan and Alaaddin.

891
01:49:47,480 --> 01:49:52,039
Lovers have different eyes but the same looks.

892
01:49:52,480 --> 01:49:55,519
And our struggle is a garden of roses.

893
01:49:55,520 --> 01:49:58,519
The rose is a gift but the thorn is a hardship.

894
01:49:59,000 --> 01:50:03,039
But our cause will grow bigger
as we endure these hardships.

895
01:50:03,200 --> 01:50:07,679
We endured these hardships, now
our children are...

896
01:50:08,000 --> 01:50:11,519
-And then their children will.
-If Allah permits.

897
01:50:12,480 --> 01:50:17,519
May Allah relieve their hearts
and make their hardships easy.

898
01:50:17,520 --> 01:50:19,519
Aameen. Aameen.

899
01:50:19,520 --> 01:50:24,039
May Allah keep our children
and family in the right path.

900
01:50:24,040 --> 01:50:26,039
-Aameen.
-Come on.

901
01:50:26,040 --> 01:50:30,039
Everyone is waiting for us to join iftar. Let's go.

902
01:50:34,480 --> 01:50:37,519
It looks so nice.

903
01:50:38,000 --> 01:50:41,519
Who knows how delicious it is?

904
01:50:42,480 --> 01:50:46,519
Allah! Mother! When is the azan?

905
01:50:46,520 --> 01:50:50,519
Very soon. Come on.

906
01:50:51,000 --> 01:50:53,519
Ghazi, stop smelling.
It might break your fast.

907
01:50:53,520 --> 01:50:57,039
Soon we will meet.

908
01:51:00,000 --> 01:51:02,519
What was that?

909
01:51:03,000 --> 01:51:07,039
Is it coming from your
stomach? Are you that hungry?

910
01:51:07,040 --> 01:51:10,039
Yes, it's coming from my stomach.

911
01:51:10,040 --> 01:51:14,039
"Give me food", it cries!
-Give me food;

912
01:51:15,000 --> 01:51:18,039
He's just like your father! My boy!

913
01:51:18,040 --> 01:51:21,039
Couldn't he find anything else to take from you?

914
01:51:26,480 --> 01:51:33,039
It looks yummy! My Allah! Thank You for Your gifts!

915
01:51:38,000 --> 01:51:42,519
My favorite. From the fattiest part!

916
01:51:46,480 --> 01:51:49,039
Father.

917
01:51:49,480 --> 01:51:54,039
You're my father but this
bulgur with meat is my right!

918
01:51:54,040 --> 01:51:56,519
My mother made it for me!

919
01:51:56,520 --> 01:51:59,039
Is this how you respect your father?

920
01:51:59,040 --> 01:52:02,519
Stop playing over it!
Cerkutay, stop acting childish

921
01:52:06,000 --> 01:52:10,039
-Is that Gonca Hatun?
-Gonca Hatun?

922
01:52:13,480 --> 01:52:17,519
-You lost due your weakness, son.
-Oh?

923
01:52:19,000 --> 01:52:22,039
He should have no weaknesses?

924
01:52:26,000 --> 01:52:29,039
Give that plate to the kid.

925
01:52:37,000 --> 01:52:41,519
What should I do?
Shall I starve to death?

926
01:52:42,480 --> 01:52:45,519
I would never leave you hungry.

927
01:52:46,000 --> 01:52:49,519
-The meatiest part is yours.
-My hatun...

928
01:52:49,520 --> 01:52:52,039
My hatun... Ghazi, you know what?

929
01:52:52,040 --> 01:52:56,039
Your mother is the best.

930
01:52:57,480 --> 01:53:00,039
-I can never do that to you.
-My hatun...

931
01:53:00,040 --> 01:53:02,519
I made this for you.
-You're beautiful.

932
01:53:02,520 --> 01:53:05,519
Mother. If you
wait a bit longer,

933
01:53:06,000 --> 01:53:08,519
...alps will have iftar with water.

934
01:53:09,480 --> 01:53:12,039
He's right.

935
01:53:43,480 --> 01:53:46,039
My Bey.

936
01:53:47,480 --> 01:53:50,039
In the name of Allah, the
merciful, the compassionate.

937
01:53:52,000 --> 01:53:54,519
Thank you, mother.

938
01:53:55,000 --> 01:53:57,519
In the name of Allah, the
merciful, the compassionate

939
01:54:00,480 --> 01:54:03,519
May Allah accept our fasting.

940
01:54:03,520 --> 01:54:05,519
-Aameen.
-Aameen.

941
01:54:05,520 --> 01:54:08,039
Aameen.

942
01:54:08,480 --> 01:54:11,039
In the name of Allah, the
merciful, the compassionate

943
01:54:11,480 --> 01:54:14,039
Here. Thank you.

944
01:54:14,040 --> 01:54:16,519
In the name of Allah, the
merciful, the compassionate

945
01:54:24,480 --> 01:54:28,039
InshaAllah our gaza will be accepted, my Bey.

946
01:54:28,480 --> 01:54:32,039
On this blessed day, while the
Crusaders are coming upon us...

947
01:54:32,040 --> 01:54:34,519
...you become a shield for the oppressed.

948
01:54:34,520 --> 01:54:39,519
Whoever holds the banner would have done the same.

949
01:54:40,480 --> 01:54:44,519
We have destroyed the Franks. Now...

950
01:54:44,520 --> 01:54:48,039
...now, it is the turn of the Catalan leader.

951
01:54:48,480 --> 01:54:51,458
Imren fell into the trap,
my Bey. When he reveals

952
01:54:51,470 --> 01:54:54,519
the location, this matter
will be over, InshaAllah.

953
01:54:55,000 --> 01:55:00,039
The Crusaders will know that only
death awaits them in these lands, brother.

954
01:55:00,480 --> 01:55:05,519
Look at them... They turn into
lions when talking about war.

955
01:55:05,520 --> 01:55:09,039
O Praise be to my valiants.

956
01:55:11,480 --> 01:55:17,519
My Bey... My brothers can
sacrifice anything for this.

957
01:55:21,480 --> 01:55:24,519
We are doing our duty, sister.

958
01:55:25,000 --> 01:55:30,039
What about the Cardinal and messengers, my Bey?
-After destroying the Catalans...

959
01:55:30,480 --> 01:55:33,039
...we will find a solution for that.

960
01:55:34,000 --> 01:55:37,039
In the end, it will be Imren Tegin's turn.

961
01:55:39,480 --> 01:55:41,039
The victory will be Osman Bey's again, right?

962
01:55:41,040 --> 01:55:45,519
Victory will always belong to Islam.

963
01:56:01,480 --> 01:56:06,039
Aykurt... You were saying
something, come on, say it.

964
01:56:06,480 --> 01:56:09,519
You are right, Solgur Agha.

965
01:56:09,520 --> 01:56:12,519
Brothers... You were not there, but...

966
01:56:13,000 --> 01:56:18,039
...Cerkutay Bey is my witness. I faced an infidel.

967
01:56:18,040 --> 01:56:22,039
He was giant. What did your Aykurt brother do?

968
01:56:22,040 --> 01:56:24,039
He drew his sword...

969
01:56:24,040 --> 01:56:26,519
...he lowered his sword in such a way that...

970
01:56:27,000 --> 01:56:30,039
Well, what happened, Aykurt?
-Then...

971
01:56:31,480 --> 01:56:35,039
... split the infidel in half like an apple.

972
01:56:40,000 --> 01:56:44,519
Brother, slow down, it is not an apple.

973
01:56:45,000 --> 01:56:50,519
Oh praise be! My Aykurt
struck with the power of faith.

974
01:56:50,520 --> 01:56:54,039
Or else, which sword splits a man in half?

975
01:56:58,000 --> 01:57:01,039
Believe it or not.

976
01:57:01,040 --> 01:57:04,039
That was the story.
-We believe you, Aykurt brother...

977
01:57:04,040 --> 01:57:07,519
...we believe you. Why wouldn't we
believe? Isn’t that right, Solgur Agha?

978
01:57:07,520 --> 01:57:11,039
Sorry, if I don't see it, I don't believe it.

979
01:57:12,000 --> 01:57:15,039
I'm leaving the table then!

980
01:57:16,000 --> 01:57:20,039
Wait, give sherbet, give sherbet.

981
01:57:20,040 --> 01:57:22,519
Give sherbet.

982
01:57:25,480 --> 01:57:28,039
That's what happened.

983
01:57:44,480 --> 01:57:49,039
Tonight you fulfilled a great duty,
Alps, the infidels were defeated...

984
01:57:49,480 --> 01:57:53,039
...thanks to all of you. But the war will continue.

985
01:57:54,000 --> 01:57:56,519
From now on, we will be even more cautious.

986
01:57:57,480 --> 01:58:04,039
A mistake we make during battle
can lead us to the edge of a hill.

987
01:58:04,480 --> 01:58:07,039
Isn't that right, Boran?

988
01:58:08,480 --> 01:58:12,039
I don't know if you are talking to me, Konur.

989
01:58:12,040 --> 01:58:15,519
But I always fulfill my duty
properly, let no one doubt that.

990
01:58:15,520 --> 01:58:20,519
You do it properly, but today, Osman
-Bey almost died because of you.

991
01:58:21,000 --> 01:58:24,519
What do you say to that?

992
01:58:33,480 --> 01:58:38,519
I've been so curious since
I started talking to you.

993
01:58:38,520 --> 01:58:42,039
You accept Jesus as a Prophet...

994
01:58:42,040 --> 01:58:45,039
...but believe in Islam.

995
01:58:45,040 --> 01:58:48,519
I mean the prophecy of Muhammad.

996
01:58:49,000 --> 01:58:54,519
Dervish Efendi, tell me. How doe his happen?

997
01:58:55,000 --> 01:58:59,519
Not only him, but Allah has sent dozens of...

998
01:58:59,520 --> 01:59:02,519
...prophets since Hadhrat Adam.

999
01:59:02,520 --> 01:59:07,039
We believe each of them, according to our faith.

1000
01:59:07,480 --> 01:59:14,519
But we believe that Hadhrat
Muhammad is the last prophet.

1001
01:59:22,000 --> 01:59:25,519
So, did Muhammad, your Prophet...

1002
01:59:25,520 --> 01:59:29,039
...also face difficulties like Jesus?

1003
01:59:29,040 --> 01:59:31,519
What was he like?

1004
01:59:33,480 --> 01:59:36,039
His journey...

1005
01:59:37,480 --> 01:59:44,039
The difficulties and tests
began before he was born..

1006
01:59:44,040 --> 01:59:48,039
What was he like, you ask.

1007
01:59:49,480 --> 01:59:54,519
I will tell you, sure. He was
called Muhammad-ul Amin...

1008
01:59:55,000 --> 01:59:59,519
...even before nubuwwah. Do you know why?

1009
02:00:00,000 --> 02:00:04,519
He does not betray trusts, he does not lie...

1010
02:00:05,000 --> 02:00:08,039
...and he is fair.

1011
02:00:09,000 --> 02:00:11,519
Have you heard about the Kaaba?

1012
02:00:12,480 --> 02:00:15,039
Your pilgrimage place.

1013
02:00:17,000 --> 02:00:23,039
The two prominent tribes of
Mecca had a dispute about placing...

1014
02:00:23,040 --> 02:00:27,039
...the Black Stone in the Kaaba.

1015
02:00:27,040 --> 02:00:31,039
One said, "We are the noblest tribe of Mecca.

1016
02:00:31,040 --> 02:00:35,039
It suits us to place the
stone." The others objected...

1017
02:00:35,040 --> 02:00:39,039
"We will not let this happen." they said. They...

1018
02:00:39,040 --> 02:00:43,039
...almost came to the point
of strangling each other.

1019
02:00:43,040 --> 02:00:46,039
At that moment, Hadhrat Muhammad came.

1020
02:00:46,480 --> 02:00:51,519
They said, "Let's ask
Muhammad, let him decide for us.

1021
02:00:51,520 --> 02:00:55,519
Let him decide who will place the Black Stone.

1022
02:00:55,520 --> 02:01:00,519
He will secure the justice." The
Messenger of Allah accepted it.

1023
02:01:01,000 --> 02:01:04,039
He took off his blessed
cloak and put it on the ground.

1024
02:01:04,040 --> 02:01:06,519
He placed the Black Stone on it.

1025
02:01:07,000 --> 02:01:10,519
He made the leader of one
tribe hold one end of the cloak...

1026
02:01:10,520 --> 02:01:14,519
...and the leader of the other tribe the other end.

1027
02:01:15,000 --> 02:01:21,039
Thus, he resolved the
dispute between the two tribes.

1028
02:01:23,480 --> 02:01:26,039
It is a beautiful story.

1029
02:01:27,000 --> 02:01:30,519
I've told you just a drop from the ocean.

1030
02:01:30,520 --> 02:01:36,519
There is much more, but our words are not enough.

1031
02:02:04,480 --> 02:02:08,039
My son... -My Bey... -Sit down.

1032
02:02:10,000 --> 02:02:15,519
What's that? You've brought the
stars down by watching them, huh? ..

1033
02:02:16,480 --> 02:02:21,519
I am watching them. But am I seeing it?

1034
02:02:22,480 --> 02:02:25,039
That's doubtful, father.
-So are you saying that you can't differentiate...

1035
02:02:26,480 --> 02:02:31,039
...between the day and night?
-Not at all, my Bey.

1036
02:02:31,480 --> 02:02:34,039
Our cause does not allow blindness.

1037
02:02:34,480 --> 02:02:39,039
Above all, you taught us this.

1038
02:02:42,000 --> 02:02:46,519
Shahzade Orhan. My son.

1039
02:02:47,000 --> 02:02:52,519
You are hiding the distress you are suffering.

1040
02:02:54,000 --> 02:02:59,519
Your father knows everything, my son. Everything.

1041
02:03:00,000 --> 02:03:02,519
You gave up your love for our cause.

1042
02:03:02,520 --> 02:03:06,039
I did what I had to do for my duty my Bey.

1043
02:03:06,040 --> 02:03:09,519
I have no complaint, and I can never complain.

1044
02:03:12,000 --> 02:03:18,039
Besides, when everything is revealed,
Holofira will go to Constantinople.

1045
02:03:18,480 --> 02:03:21,519
I won't be able to see her again.

1046
02:03:22,480 --> 02:03:26,519
My son... My son...
-But you mentioned the stars, my Bey...

1047
02:03:26,520 --> 02:03:32,039
When night falls, looking at the starry sky...

1048
02:03:32,480 --> 02:03:36,039
...feels like looking at her face.

1049
02:03:38,480 --> 02:03:41,519
That's why I get lost in it like that.

1050
02:03:49,480 --> 02:03:52,039
Look...

1051
02:03:52,480 --> 02:03:58,039
You will live whatever is in your fate.

1052
02:03:58,480 --> 02:04:02,519
If it is destined for you to
experience this love again...

1053
02:04:03,000 --> 02:04:06,519
...then Holofira will surely return to you.

1054
02:04:07,000 --> 02:04:10,519
What if it's not, my Bey?

1055
02:04:12,480 --> 02:04:15,519
Also

1056
02:04:16,480 --> 02:04:20,519
What happens if Holofira and I cross paths again?

1057
02:04:20,520 --> 02:04:26,519
I'll have another family with someone else.

1058
02:04:32,480 --> 02:04:38,039
My Bey, we buried our love for our cause.

1059
02:04:39,000 --> 02:04:45,039
There's nothing important
than the future of our Beylik.

1060
02:04:50,480 --> 02:04:56,039
The teravih time is soon.
Let's go and perform ablution.

1061
02:04:56,480 --> 02:04:59,039
Come on.

1062
02:05:22,000 --> 02:05:25,039
How did she trick me?

1063
02:05:25,480 --> 02:05:29,039
We thought she was a wounded
gazelle, but she turned out to be a snake.

1064
02:05:30,480 --> 02:05:35,039
She was a snake but she got
what she deserved, thankfully.

1065
02:05:36,480 --> 02:05:40,519
Now it's time to cut the head of the snake.

1066
02:05:40,520 --> 02:05:44,519
Then she must be the one who poisoned Ayca.

1067
02:05:46,480 --> 02:05:49,039
Maybe it was all a game.

1068
02:05:49,040 --> 02:05:54,039
Maybe Olivia used her and she
killed her when she is done with her.

1069
02:05:56,480 --> 02:06:01,519
Maybe both of them were working with Imren.

1070
02:06:01,520 --> 02:06:06,519
So Holofira died in vain, is that so, Bala Hatun?

1071
02:06:07,480 --> 02:06:11,519
Why did Holofira accept the crime
and risked death if she was innocent?

1072
02:06:11,520 --> 02:06:16,039
It seems they played tricks
on Holofira, Elcim Hatun.

1073
02:06:16,040 --> 02:06:22,519
But even though you all knew her, you blamed her.

1074
02:06:24,000 --> 02:06:29,039
She wouldn't have taken
the blame. They're all guilty.

1075
02:06:30,480 --> 02:06:33,039
Maybe Hilal was working for her?

1076
02:06:33,040 --> 02:06:37,039
-Holofira is an infidel, Gonca Hatun.
-If Holofira

1077
02:06:37,480 --> 02:06:41,519
had told us the truth, we would have helped her.

1078
02:06:42,000 --> 02:06:46,039
Gonca daughter. But she pleaded guilty.

1079
02:06:47,000 --> 02:06:52,519
If you had believed her,
maybe she would have told you.

1080
02:06:53,000 --> 02:06:55,519
But you put pressure on her.

1081
02:06:55,520 --> 02:06:58,039
It seems you left Holofira no other chance.

1082
02:06:58,040 --> 02:07:01,519
She pleaded guilty because she was guilty.

1083
02:07:03,000 --> 02:07:05,519
She got what she deserved.

1084
02:07:07,000 --> 02:07:11,519
That snake-tongued girl tricked you.

1085
02:07:13,480 --> 02:07:18,519
Sister-in-law, it's not proper
for us to speak ill of the dead.

1086
02:07:18,520 --> 02:07:22,519
She was a murderer, how should I talk about her?

1087
02:07:23,480 --> 02:07:26,519
Holofira was not a murderer Ayca Hatun.

1088
02:07:27,000 --> 02:07:32,519
-She was innocent.
-She was innocent, is that so?

1089
02:07:33,480 --> 02:07:36,519
That girl was a bloody murderer.

1090
02:07:36,520 --> 02:07:39,519
She tricked you all.

1091
02:07:41,480 --> 02:07:48,039
But I told you. That girl brought
trouble and blood to this house.

1092
02:07:48,480 --> 02:07:54,039
-This blood cannot be cleaned.
-Enough, Ayca.

1093
02:07:54,040 --> 02:07:57,519
Shut up now.

1094
02:08:02,000 --> 02:08:06,039
There will be blood.

1095
02:08:07,480 --> 02:08:11,039
They are blind.

1096
02:08:16,480 --> 02:08:21,519
Only you can see the truth.

1097
02:08:30,480 --> 02:08:34,039
You're still defending the dead.

1098
02:08:34,040 --> 02:08:39,039
But she shed the first blood in
the palace. She tried to kill me.

1099
02:08:39,480 --> 02:08:42,039
-That's enough.
No.

1100
02:08:42,040 --> 02:08:45,039
-It's not enough.
-Sister in law.

1101
02:08:45,040 --> 02:08:49,039
The wedding will be bloody.

1102
02:08:51,480 --> 02:08:57,039
There will be bloodshed.

1103
02:09:11,000 --> 02:09:14,519
Forgive me.

1104
02:09:14,520 --> 02:09:20,039
This poison turned her into someone else.

1105
02:09:26,000 --> 02:09:31,519
Think before you talk, Konur,
I always protect Osman Bey.

1106
02:09:31,520 --> 02:09:34,039
I never hesitate to put myself at risk.

1107
02:09:34,040 --> 02:09:38,519
You can only talk. If I didn't get there
on time, Osman Bey would be dead now.

1108
02:09:38,520 --> 02:09:41,519
Be careful! Talk carefully.

1109
02:09:41,520 --> 02:09:44,519
You're the one who can only talk.

1110
02:09:45,000 --> 02:09:49,039
You keep making mistakes. Tell me,

1111
02:09:49,040 --> 02:09:53,039
wasn't Kite outpost under your command?

1112
02:09:53,040 --> 02:09:58,519
How did they attack the hidden
outpost? Why didn't you take precautions?

1113
02:09:58,520 --> 02:10:03,039
Boran Bey, what kind of blame is
this? We were also in the Kite outpost.

1114
02:10:03,480 --> 02:10:07,519
-We took proper precautions.
-Aykurt brother,

1115
02:10:08,000 --> 02:10:10,519
while Beys are talking

1116
02:10:11,000 --> 02:10:14,519
-it’s not our place to talk,
said what I had to say, Aykurt.

1117
02:10:14,520 --> 02:10:18,519
Understand the rest as you wish.

1118
02:10:21,480 --> 02:10:24,519
Boran, you say that Kite outpost was attacked

1119
02:10:25,000 --> 02:10:27,519
but you didn't say a word
when its place was discovered.

1120
02:10:28,000 --> 02:10:31,039
What your spies were doing
when Imren attacked the outpost?

1121
02:10:31,040 --> 02:10:33,519
Were they looking around idly?

1122
02:10:34,000 --> 02:10:36,519
Brothers, brothers, what are you doing?

1123
02:10:36,520 --> 02:10:39,519
What are you doing brothers?

1124
02:10:41,000 --> 02:10:44,039
Don't do it. Our fight is with the
infidels and our wrath is towards them.

1125
02:10:47,480 --> 02:10:49,519
Everyone knows it.

1126
02:10:49,520 --> 02:10:55,039
Boran brother values Osman
Bey's life more than his own life.

1127
02:10:55,480 --> 02:11:02,039
Konur Bey is known for his
order and his love for his alps.

1128
02:11:02,480 --> 02:11:05,519
Don't do it brothers. It doesn't suit us.

1129
02:11:06,000 --> 02:11:09,519
I kept my silence until now just
because it doesn't suit us, brother.

1130
02:11:09,520 --> 02:11:13,039
But those who joined Osman Bey on the road

1131
02:11:13,040 --> 02:11:15,519
equate themselves to those who set out with him.

1132
02:11:15,520 --> 02:11:19,519
I've protected Osman Bey from the beginning.

1133
02:11:21,480 --> 02:11:26,519
Let me tell you, my Bey doesn't carry
the wound I opened on his back, Konur.

1134
02:11:26,520 --> 02:11:28,039
Boran, Boran.

1135
02:11:28,040 --> 02:11:31,039
If you knew yourself well, you wouldn't
have mentioned about the old incidents.

1136
02:11:31,040 --> 02:11:33,528
If you had done your
duty properly then, Osman

1137
02:11:33,540 --> 02:11:36,039
Bey wouldn’t have that
wound on his back today.

1138
02:11:36,040 --> 02:11:38,519
Boran, Boran!

1139
02:11:40,480 --> 02:11:42,039
-Let go off me!
-Boran!

1140
02:11:42,040 --> 02:11:45,039
I wish you were so tough on
the field while protecting my Bey.

1141
02:11:45,040 --> 02:11:47,519
I'll ruin you!

1142
02:11:54,480 --> 02:11:57,519
What did you do, brothers?

1143
02:11:57,520 --> 02:12:00,039
Baysungur

1144
02:12:00,040 --> 02:12:05,039
-Boran! Boran! What did you do?
-Let go off me!

1145
02:12:05,040 --> 02:12:09,039
-Alps!
-Osman Bey is coming.

1146
02:12:17,480 --> 02:12:20,519
What’s going on here?

1147
02:12:22,000 --> 02:12:24,519
Huh?

1148
02:12:29,000 --> 02:12:36,039
What's this situation? What happened here?

1149
02:12:37,480 --> 02:12:40,519
Are you shedding each other's blood?

1150
02:12:41,000 --> 02:12:44,039
Answer me!

1151
02:12:45,480 --> 02:12:51,519
And you keep your head
down? Look as angry as before!

1152
02:12:54,480 --> 02:12:58,039
You're the alps of Kayi! Does it suit you?

1153
02:12:58,040 --> 02:13:00,519
-My Bey.
-Shut up!

1154
02:13:00,520 --> 02:13:04,519
Nothing is enough to explain this.

1155
02:13:05,480 --> 02:13:10,039
Tell me. Tell me what was the problem.

1156
02:13:10,480 --> 02:13:14,039
What was the problem between you?

1157
02:13:16,480 --> 02:13:21,039
You even let alps join the fight.

1158
02:13:24,000 --> 02:13:28,519
Is it terrible that you came to the tribe?

1159
02:13:28,520 --> 02:13:32,039
Did you feel bad about it? Did
you want to show your bravery?

1160
02:13:32,040 --> 02:13:36,039
If that's the case, you'll do it on the field!

1161
02:13:39,000 --> 02:13:44,519
There is no self in our cause.

1162
02:13:44,520 --> 02:13:50,519
You can never turn your back to each
other while you are fighting side by side!

1163
02:13:53,000 --> 02:13:59,039
You were conquering castles
with thousands of men behind you.

1164
02:14:00,000 --> 02:14:04,519
You were shaking the
battlefields, what happened now?

1165
02:14:07,480 --> 02:14:12,519
Did you lose your temper with each other?

1166
02:14:15,040 --> 02:14:18,039
If you do this

1167
02:14:18,040 --> 02:14:22,519
you will drag everyone behind you into the abyss.

1168
02:14:24,000 --> 02:14:30,039
I would never let something like
that happen to the army of Kayi.

1169
02:14:33,000 --> 02:14:35,519
-Cerkutay.
-My Bey.

1170
02:14:35,520 --> 02:14:38,039
Take their swords.

1171
02:14:40,000 --> 02:14:46,039
There will be a court tomorrow.
Whatever your judgment is, you will abide.

1172
02:14:46,480 --> 02:14:50,039
-Yes, my Bey.
-Take their swords.

1173
02:15:05,000 --> 02:15:07,519
Take them to the dungeon.

1174
02:15:10,000 --> 02:15:12,519
Shame on you.

1175
02:15:16,480 --> 02:15:19,039
Now get lost.

1176
02:15:19,388 --> 02:15:49,028
Visit turkision.com for more!